<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">- Etulo</book>
  <para style="h">Iba</para>
  <para style="toc1">Iba ngwi a kye tso iJɔn</para>
  <para style="toc2">Iba</para>
  <para style="toc3">Iba</para>
  <para style="mt1">Iba</para>
  <para style="mt2">ngwi a kye tso iJɔn</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Owita-wita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1"/>Iba mgbi iYesu iKrestu, ongwi Imgbasho kye nun ikye okye tso ɛngbɛ mgban ungwɔ ama nka kye onɔ bata kawa kyɔ mani. O non tsotɔ mi odɔ ongyesɔ mgban esɔ mbi ongbidɔ mgban iJɔn, <verse eid="REV 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2"/>ngwu nkyɔ obwɛndɛ mi alungwɔ ngwi ongwu di ngwi li, elodzɛ mgbi Imgbasho yi obwɛndɛ mgbi iYesu iKrestu. <verse eid="REV 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3"/>Mse ka bɛ inggisɛ ngwu ngbɔ elodzɛ mgbi oyegbɔ nɛ ewo, mse dika bɛ ama nfwo di noyɛyɛ mi ungwɔ ngwi a lɔ to ele nɛ ewo, ikyekyɛ onɔ ma dzɛ kwɛkwɛ wa.<verse eid="REV 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Angba bɛyi otsɛɛtsɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4"/>Afɛ nɛ kyɛ mbi iJɔn kɛ mbi okwakye mgbi ama onoyɛyɛ nghi egyafa mi ɛsɛ Asia gbɛɛ: elela bɛyi iyu nkyɛ mbi ongwu ndzɛ onɛnɛ, ongwu nteyi dzɛ, dika wa dzɛ na, yi mbi onodzi egyafa ama nkwudzɛ iyayi itsuutɔ mgban na nu ma dzɛ yi ema, <verse eid="REV 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5"/>bɛyi mbi iYesu iKrestu ongwu nli obwɛndɛ otsitsi, ongwovlɛ mbi emi ikwukwɔ, bɛyi ongye oteyi mgbi emi utɔ mi ɛsɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:5">Mbi ongwu ndi eyi kpan itukwu di dulu eyi tɔ mi ali ibwubwe mgbi eyi mi eyi mgban, <verse eid="REV 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6"/>di nu eyi yɛɛ esutɔ onyi bɛyi ama ofifɛ ikye okyɔ Imgbasho bɛyi otsongwu idɔ mani, okwɔkwɔ yi mfye no dzɛ mbon nghataa gyegwu! No dzɛ ngha.<verse eid="REV 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7"/>Dii o ka yɛkyɛ mi akpa mi esho, ma ali inɛ duu ka dun, yi ama nton okpa ma kpaa; man inggisɛ mi ɛsɛ duu ka tsukwu ikyon. Li ngha nka dzɛ aali! No dzɛ ngha.<verse eid="REV 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8"/>Otsɛ Imgbasho gbɔgbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ani li owita-wita bɛyi ongyɛɛngyɛ, Ongwu ndzɛ onɛnɛ, yi ongwu nteyi dzɛ, yi ongwu ndika wa ba, ongwu nghaangha duu mani!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Inɛ odiidi mgbi Ongwɛ Inggisɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9"/>Ani, iJɔn, ongwunema yi ibuge mgbi ema mi adzɛ ogyeegye yi esutɔ mgbi okwonyɔtsɛ yi itukwu oshiishi mgbi eyi mbi iYesu, kɛdzɛ ibu ongwi iPatimo mi ikye elodzimgbasho bɛyi obwɛndɛ mgbi iYesu. <verse eid="REV 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10"/>Mi egbe mgbi Otsɛ ma Onodzi kye ani teyi, man ani fwo onikyɔ ela mi iyikpa mbi ani dafi agba mani, <verse eid="REV 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11"/>ela na gbɛɛ: &lt;&lt;Lɔ mi afɛ ungwɔ ngwi abu di mani kye dɛsɔ nu okwakye mgbi ama onoyɛyɛ egyafa ntonani: Mbi emi Efesu yi iSimina yi iPegamu yi iTyatira yi iSadi yi iFyiladefyia bɛyi iLaodisia.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12"/>Ani kyata gbɛɛ ni ani di ela nle gbɔdzɛ yi ani mani. Onɔ ngwi ani kyata ma, ani di otlɛsɛ abashi mgbi ola nghi egyafa, <verse eid="REV 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13"/>ma mi idzidzɛ otlɛsɛ ntona &lt;&lt;Inggisɛ oka dzɛ ele dafi Ongwɛ Inggisɛ mani,&gt;&gt; wo angwuto owulu-wulu kyɛ esho lu afɔ mi esɛ yi ayangwuto abashi nyɛ igɛgɛ mgban. <verse eid="REV 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14"/>Otu mi ikye mgban tundzɛ dafi ofufitu, i tundzɛ dafi akwummbwo, inɛ mgban di dzɛ dafi abɔ onaana mgbi ola mani. <verse eid="REV 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15"/>Afɔ mgban mi esɛ dzɛ dafi iyudza ngwi a gyuon enotse omuma oshinishini mani, ela mgban di dzɛ dafi adu eni nle kwobu mani. <verse eid="REV 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16"/>O byi mcɛ nghi egyafa mi abugye mgban, ma mi ondu mgban okwusunkli ngyigye agya efa tɔ mi ele. Inɛ mgban dzɛ dafi onɔ le kwɔ mi idzidzɛ udɛ mani.<verse eid="REV 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17"/>Ngwi ani din nɛ, ani si gbɛsɛ lankɛ iyayi dafi ani kwulu mani. Nɛ o kye abugye mgban dɔ ani ewo si gbɛɛ: &lt;&lt;Ka mio ba. Ani li ongwu ababɔ bɛyi ongwu olɛlɛ mani. <verse eid="REV 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18"/>Ani li ongwu ndzɛ oshishe mani; ani plɛ kwulu, kpaa onɛnɛ dika ani dzɛ oshishe nghataa gyegwu! Ani di dzɛ yi ungwɔ okwulu ofɛ mgbi ikwongye bɛyi endzi.<verse eid="REV 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19"/>&lt;&lt;Nɛ kye lɔlu, ungwɔ ngwi abu di, ngwi dzɛ onɛnɛ bɛyi ungwɔ nkawa kyɔ mi iyayi. <verse eid="REV 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20"/>Ungwɔ odaada mgbi mcɛ egyafa ngwi abu di mi abugye mgbi ani bɛyi otlɛsɛ mgbi ola okwɔkwɔ ma li ongwu aani: Mcɛ egyafa ntona li engyesɔ mgbi okwakye mgbi ama onoyɛyɛ egyafa ntonani, otlɛsɛ egyafa mgbi ola ntona li okwakye mgbi ama onoyɛyɛ egyafa ntonani.<verse eid="REV 1:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Esɔ mbi emi Efesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1"/>&lt;&lt;Lɔ ungwɔ ntonɛ kɛ mbi ongyesɔ mgbi okwakye mgbi ama onoyɛyɛ mi Efesu gbɛɛ: Nɛnɛ li elodzɛ mgbi ongwu nbyi mcɛ nghi egyafa mi abugye mgban di kyikyɛ mi idzidzɛ otlɛsɛ mgbi ola okwɔkwɔ nani: <verse eid="REV 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2"/>Ani ye idɔ ngwi abu kyɔ mani, okwunewo idɔ mgbi abu yi itukwu oshiishi. Ani ye abu ka gbela yi emi imbaali ba, ikyesinɛ abu mbadi ama ntso gbɛɛ di ama li ama ogbikye iYesu kpaa a li ama ba, di difwi gbɛɛ a li ama omwonya. <verse eid="REV 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3"/>Abu kwonyɔtsɛ, di gyadzɛ mi ikye mgbi ani, abu di yɛyikpa ba.<verse eid="REV 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4"/>Kpaa li ungwɔ nkpa ani yi abu ba aani: Abu dzata okpitukwu mgbi abu ongwi ababɔ nani. <verse eid="REV 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5"/>Wɛ imbe abu gbɛsɛ mani! Kyatitukwu diyɛ kyungwɔ ama ngwi abu teyi kyɔ ma ababɔ mani. Ni abu kyatitukwu ba, n ka ba mbi abu wa kyi kwɔlu otlɛsɛ mgbi ola okwɔkwɔ mgbi abu na mi imbe mgban. <verse eid="REV 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6"/>Nghaduu li ikyese mgbi abu aani: Abu di okyɔɔkyɔ mgbi emi iNikoleti tanyi, dafi ani kpaa di tanyi nɛni.<verse eid="REV 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7"/>Inggisɛ ndzɛ yi adɔ, otsungwɔn no fwo odzɛ ngwi Onodzi gbɔ yi emi okwakye mgbi ama onoyɛyɛ nɛni. Ongwu ngha ma, n ka nun ofɛ no gye ekwɔ mgbi oshishe, ndzɛ mi iPradiso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">iPradiso </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Li imbe ngwi ungwɔ osuse kyoon to.</char></note> mgbi Imgbasho nani.<verse eid="REV 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Esɔ mbi emi iSimina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8"/>Lɔ ungwɔ ntonɛ kɛ mbi ongyesɔ ongwi okwakye mgbi ama onoyɛyɛ mi iSimina gbɛɛ: Nɛnɛ li elodzɛ mgbi ongwu nli ababɔ di li olɛlɛ, ongwu nkwulu diyɛ kyato dzɛ oshishe nani. <verse eid="REV 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9"/>Ani ye okakewo yi adzɛ mgbi abu nghaduu abu dzɛ aludu! Ani ye odzɛ ibwubwe ngwi inggisɛ ama ngbɛɛ ama li emi iJuda kpaa li emi iJuda ba le gbɔ mi ikpewo abu mani, kpaa a li ozu okwakye mgbi iSatan. <verse eid="REV 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10"/>Ka wimio mi ungwɔ ngwi abu le ka gyadzɛ mi ele na ba. N nya abu, Olodu ka gbe ema angbeka wokɛ obawi ikye ombadi ema, ema dika gbiisɔ mi egbe iwyo. Shitukwu kpɔɔ, nghataa kɛ onɔ ikwongye, man ani ka kye okpaapyi mgbi oshishe nu abu.<verse eid="REV 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11"/>Inggisɛ ndzɛ yi adɔ, otsungwɔn no fwo odzɛ ngwi Onodzi gbɔ yi emi okwakye mgbi ama onoyɛyɛ nɛni. Inggisɛ nngha ma, ka gyisɔ mi ikwongye ongwu fan na wuba.<verse eid="REV 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Esɔ mbi emi iPegamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12"/>Lɔ ungwɔ ntonɛ kɛ mbi ongyesɔ ongwi okwakye mgbi ama onoyɛyɛ mi iPegamu gbɛɛ: Nɛnɛ li elodzɛ mgbi ongwu ndzɛ yi okwusunkli ngyigye agya efa nani. <verse eid="REV 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13"/>Ani ye imbe ngwi abu dzɛ na li imbe ngwi itsuutɔ mgbi iSatan dzɛ aali. Nghaduu abu kwudzɛ mi oyɛyɛ onuunu mi iyi mgbi ani. Abu tangwɛ oyɛyɛ onuunu mgbi abu mbi ani ba, mi egbe mgbi Antipa ma kpaa, obwɛndɛ mgbi ani otsitsi, a ngwɔn mi ogalu mgbi ema imbe ngwi iSatan dzɛ nani.<verse eid="REV 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14"/>Nghanɛ kpaa, ani dzɛ yi ungwɔ gwee ngwi ani ka bɛwo ema ba: Ema to yi inggisɛ mmana ngwu gbela yi otsootso mgbi iBalan, ongwu ntso iBalaki ogbe emi iSrai teyi oka kyɔ alobube mgbi ogye ungwogye ngwi a kye fifɛ nu emi angwula bɛyi okyɔ amah nani. <verse eid="REV 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15"/>Li ngha ngwi ema kpaa dzɛ yi inggisɛ ama ngbela yi otsootso mgbi emi iNikoleti aali. <verse eid="REV 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16"/>Nghanɛ kyatitukwu na! Lubana, ani ka ba mbi ema plɛ jo owa gblika yi ama mi okwusunkli ongwi ondu mgbi ani.<verse eid="REV 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17"/>Inggisɛ ndzɛ yi adɔ no fwo odzɛ ngwi Onodzi gbɔ yi emi okwakye mgbi ama onoyɛyɛ nɛni. Mbi inggisɛ ongwu ngha, n ka nun iManna angbeka odaada. N dika nun ikwutsɛ onzundzɛ ngwi a lɔ iyi ofufɛ mi ele, ngwi inggisɛ ngbɛ ma ta ka ye.<verse eid="REV 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Esɔ mbi emi iTyatira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18"/>Lɔ ungwɔ ntonɛ kɛ mbi ongyesɔ ongwi okwakye mgbi ama onoyɛyɛ mi iTyatira gbɛɛ: Nɛnɛ li elodzɛ mgbi Ongwɛ Imgbasho, ongwu inɛ mgban dzɛ dafi ola onaabɔ ngwu afɔ mgban mi esɛ dzɛ dafi iyudza ngwi a gyuon enotse shinishini nani. <verse eid="REV 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19"/>Ani ye okyɔɔkyɔ mgbi abu, okpitukwu mgbi abu yi oyɛyɛ onuunu, idɔ yi okwonyɔtsɛ mgbi abu, di ye gbɛɛ abu le kyɔ onɛnɛ ngha ongwi abu teyi kyɔ ababɔ mani.<verse eid="REV 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20"/>Nghanɛ kpaa, li ungwɔ nkpa ani yi abu ba aani: Abu gbɛ ongyaa iJedzɛbɛ nkwu ewon di oyegbɔ na wo ewo. Mi otsootso mgban o nu engyiidɔ mgbi ani boofɛ kaka amah ibwubwe, dile gye ungwogye ngwi a kye fifɛ nu angwula. <verse eid="REV 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21"/>Ani nun onɔ gbɛɛ no kyata mi amah mgban nani, kpaa o dzɛ yi oweka ba. <verse eid="REV 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22"/>Nghanɛ n ka kyon ngwi dɔkɛ akwulo mgbi adzɛ ogyeegye, n dika nu ama nle kyɔ amah yan gyadzɛ kpakpa, sede nu ma kyatitukwu mi okyɔɔkyɔ mgban ntonani. <verse eid="REV 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23"/>N ka ngwɔn ɛngbɛ. Ta okwakye mgbi ama onoyɛyɛ duu ka ye gbɛɛ ani li kyidi ali inggisɛ mi eka yi itukwu, ma n ka yile mkpa kpa ali inggisɛ mgbi ema duu mi okyɔɔkyɔ mgbi ema. <verse eid="REV 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24"/>Onɛnɛ nle gbɔ yi ema ama nsisi mi iTyatira nɛ gbɛɛ, ema ama nkyɛdɔ mi otsootso mgban ba, di kpayi ungwɔ mgbi iSatan ngwi a li kwun di iba olu byulu ba ma, (n ka kye okakewo oka dɔ ema ikye wuba). <verse eid="REV 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25"/>Nghaduu gbɛwɛbyi otsootso ngwi ema dzɛyan na kyoon nghataa ni ani wa yidɔ.<verse eid="REV 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26"/>Mbi inggisɛ ngwu ngha di kyɔ owitukwu mgbi ani ka dondu ma, n ka nun mfye mi ikye ɛsɛ ibyibyi.<verse eid="REV 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27"/>O ka kye ma teyi yi okwuta utɔ ashashi; o ka gbobu ma ambulu-ambulu dafi ishe&gt; yɛyɛ dafi ani gbɛ mfye mbi Otsani mani. <verse eid="REV 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28"/>N dika kye Oshɛbɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:28 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Oshɛbɛ </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Li umba ngwi a ka kye nu ama ngwu ngha</char></note> nun. <verse eid="REV 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29"/>Inggisɛ ndzɛ yi adɔ yɔ, no fwo odzɛ ngwi Onodzi gbɔ yi okwakye mgbi ama onoyɛyɛ nɛni.<verse eid="REV 2:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Esɔ mbi emi iSadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1"/>Lɔ kɛ mbi ongyesɔ ongwi okwakye mgbi ama onoyɛyɛ mi iSadi gbɛɛ: Ntonɛ li elodzɛ mgbi ongwu nbyi Onodzi mgbi Imgbasho egyafa bɛyi mcɛ egyafa nani. Ani ye okyɔɔkyɔ mgbi abu; ali inggisɛ duu tsɛwɛ gbɛɛ abu ka dzɛ oshishe mi onodzi, kpa o li ikwukwɔ. <verse eid="REV 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2"/>Ngyo! Ni oyɛyɛ onuunu mgbi abu nsisi dzɛ na fyumfye di i wa kwulu, ikyesinɛ ani di okyɔɔkyɔ mgbi abu mbi Imgbasho mgbi ani saan ngyɛ ba. <verse eid="REV 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3"/>Nghanɛ wɛ, ungwɔ ngwi abu teyi gbɛ di fwo mani; kyɔ mi ele, di kyatitukwu. Kpaa kini abu ngyo bayɔ, n ka ba dafi emumyi mani, ma abu ka ye onɔ ngwi ani ka ba mbi abu ba. <verse eid="REV 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4"/>Nghaduu ema to yi inggisɛ gwee mi iSadi ama nnu angwuto mgbi ama shimbi ba mani. A ka wewo mi angwuto onzundzɛ kyikyɛ yi ani, ikyesinɛ a mɛ. <verse eid="REV 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5"/>Inggisɛ nngha ma, ka wo angwuto onzundzɛ dafi ama mani. Ani dika dulu iyi mgban mi afɛ mgbi oshishe ba, kpaa n ka kye iyi mgban tso mi ododa mi inai Otsani yi engyesɔ mgban. <verse eid="REV 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6"/>Inggisɛ ndzɛ yi adɔ yɔ, no fwo odzɛ ngwi Onodzi gbɔ yi emi okwakye mgbi ama onoyɛyɛ nɛni.<verse eid="REV 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Esɔ mbi emi iFyiladefyia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7"/>Lɔ kɛ mbi ongyesɔ ongwi okwakye mgbi ama onoyɛyɛ mi iFyiladefyia gbɛɛ: Nɛnɛ li elodzɛ mgbi ongwu nle saan di dzɛ yi oyɛyɛ, ongwu nbyi ungwɔ okwulu ofɛ mgbi iDevedi. Ungwɔ ngwi o kwulu inggisɛ onyi ka kye tukwu gbɛ ba, ungwɔ ngwi o di kye tukwu inggisɛ onyi ka kwulu gbɛ ba. <verse eid="REV 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8"/>Ani ye ungwɔ ngwi abu kyɔ. Di, ani kwulu ofɛ lakɛ asisa ikye abu, ngwi inggisɛ onyi ka kye tukwu gbɛ ba. Ani ye ɛnɛpɛ mɛ abu ba, nghaduu abu ngyo elodzɛ mgbi ani di tangwɛ iyi mgbi ani ba. <verse eid="REV 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9"/>N ka nu ama nto mi ozu okwakye mgbi iSatan, nli tso gbɛɛ ama li emi iJuda kpaa li ama ba, kpaa a li ama omwonya ntonani, N ka nu ma wa kwɛsɛ mi iyayi mbi abu di difwi gbɛɛ abu kpa ani itukwu. <verse eid="REV 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10"/>Ikyegbɛɛ ema ngyo ola mgbi ani di shitukwu kpɔɔ nɛ, ani kpaa ka dulu ema tɔ mi imbadi nka ba mi ikye ɛsɛ duu owa mbadi ama nto ɛsɛ mani. <verse eid="REV 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11"/>Ani kyɛma dzikan-dzikan. Kye abɔ byi ungwɔ ngwi abu dzɛyan ma kpɔklɔɔ, ikye ni inggisɛ onyi wa gbɛ abu okpapyi ba mani. <verse eid="REV 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12"/>Inggisɛ nngha ma, n ka non li otlɛsɛ mi ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho mgbi ani. Akponyi kpaa o dika dzanta ba. Ani ka lɔ iyi Imgbasho bɛyi iyi ogalu mgbi Imgbasho mgbi ani mbon, iJerosalin ofufɛ ntɔ mi esho mbi Imgbasho mgbi ani kyɛ le ba nani; ani dika lɔ iyi ofufɛ mgbi ani mbon. <verse eid="REV 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13"/>Inggisɛ ndzɛ yi adɔ, no fwo odzɛ ngwi Onodzi gbɔ yi okwakye mgbi ama onoyɛyɛ nɛni.<verse eid="REV 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Esɔ mbi emi iLaodisia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14"/>&lt;&lt;Lɔ kɛ mbi ongyesɔ ongwi okwakye mgbi ama onoyɛyɛ mi iLaodisia gbɛɛ: Ntonɛ li elodzɛ mgbi No Dzɛ Ngha mani, ongwu ndzɛ yi otsitsi bɛyi obwɛndɛ otsitsi, ongwu nli ikye mi ungwɔ ama Imgbasho ta ntonɛni. <verse eid="REV 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15"/>Ani ye ungwɔ ama abu teyi kyɔ mani; ani ye dafi abu yuyu naadi zola ba mani. Dafi i dzɛ ani ma gbɛɛ abu ki yuyu hona zola! <verse eid="REV 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16"/>Kpaa ikyegbɛɛ abu tɛwɛwɛ, abu zola hona yuyu ba nɛ, n le ka kye abu ngwuta dafi anggwɔ mi ondu mgbi ani mani. <verse eid="REV 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17"/>Abu gbɛɛ, &lt;ani dzɛ aludu; ani tu aludu di mina unkonyi wuba.&gt; Nghaduu abu difwi gbɛɛ, i ngha abu ewo, kyelela, dzɛ adzɛ, binɛ di dzɛ ibiba ba. <verse eid="REV 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18"/>Ani wɛ abu ɛwɛ gbɛɛ, ni abu gya abashi ngwi a falufa won mi ola mbi ani, ikye ni abu yɛɛ aludu; yi angwuto onzundzɛ owoowo, ikye ni abu tukwu iba ayiwi mgbi abu; yi otse okye wo inɛ mgbi abu, ikye ni abu di mani.<verse eid="REV 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19"/>Ama nkpaa ani itukwu ma, ani li kyɔkyɔ di kwo ma adɔ. Nghanɛ dzɛ mi otsitsi, di kyatitukwu. <verse eid="REV 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20"/>Gadɔ! Ani kwudzɛ onufozu le tsaabɔ! Inggisɛ ta nfwo ela mgbi ani di kwulu ofɛ yɔ, n ka kaka di gye ungwogye yan, ongwu kpaa ka gye yi ani.<verse eid="REV 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21"/>Mbi ali inggisɛ nngha duu, n ka nun ofɛ no sɔ yi ani mi itsuutɔ mgbi ani, yɛyɛ dafi ani kpaa ngha di sɔ yi Otsani mi itsuutɔ mgban nɛni. <verse eid="REV 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22"/>Inggisɛ ndzɛ yi adɔ yɔ, no fwo odzɛ ngwi Onodzi gbɔ yi okwakye mgbi ama onoyɛyɛ nɛni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 3:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Osuusunu ongwi esho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1"/>Ngwi ungwɔnɛ wa nyɛ nɛ, ani ndinɛ, ta mmana mi iyayi mgbi ani onufozu lasisa mi esho. Man ela ngwi ani teyi fwo le gbɔdzɛ yi ani dafi agba ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ba esho mmɛnɛni, ta n ka tso abu ungwɔ nka kyɔ onɔ ngwi ungwɔnɛ wa nyɛ mani.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2"/>Labɔ mata ani dzɛ mi Onodzi, man inggisɛ sɔdzɛ itsuutɔ mgbi Imgbasho wa dzɛkɛ inɛ mbi ani. <verse eid="REV 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3"/>Ongwu ndi sɔdzɛ mmana ma odzɛɛdzɛ mgban dzɛ dafi ikwutsɛ onyina-nyina bɛyi ikwutsɛ nli omuma gloglo mani. Mmbwo olowa, nlu ikwutsɛ ngwi dzɛ yi enotse dafi indrakpakpa kwɔkwɔ, loka wo itsuutɔ nani. <verse eid="REV 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4"/>Itsuutɔ angbeka nghi osudenɛ kpakɛkɛ wo itsuutɔ nani, engyukwo osudenɛ di sɔto efu tsatsadu. A wo angwuto onzundzɛ di tukwu okpapyi abashi mi ikye mgbi ama. <verse eid="REV 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5"/>Mi itsuutɔ na mmbwo naabɔ tɔ, kwadu, akpala di gbo. Ola ipitila nghi egyafa tole gbɛ mi iyayi itsuutɔ nani. Ngwi li onodzi egyafa mgbi Imgbasho mani. <verse eid="REV 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6"/>Mi iyayi itsuutɔ na ungwɔ oka di dzɛ ele dafi onekyoo idzinggi, gbosa dafi ikwutsɛ ola mani sɔdzɛ idzidzɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:6">Adan owamyɛ nghi enɛ ngwu dzɛ yi inɛ mi iyayi bɛyi iyikpa loka wo itsuutɔ nani. <verse eid="REV 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7"/>Adan owamyɛ ongwu ababɔ ma dzɛ dafi ugaba, ongwu fan dzɛ dafi mnda ngwi a won elozu, ongwu ta dzɛ yi inɛ dafi inggisɛ, ongwu nɛ dzɛ dafi uyɛɛ nle bulu mani. <verse eid="REV 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8"/>Ali atta owamyɛ enɛ ntona dzɛ yi asha egyin yi inɛ kpatsɛ ele, kwo yi asha mgban mi esɛ kpaa. Onɔ yi otu duu a yama kwulɛsɛ ogbɛɛ:</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:8">&lt;&lt;Osaan, osaan, osaan</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:8">li Otsɛ Imgbasho onghaangha,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:8">ongwu nteyi dzɛ, di dzɛ onɛnɛ, dika dzɛ nghataa gyegwu ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9"/>Alonɔ ni atta owamyɛ ntona kye okwɔkwɔ yi mmwɛ bɛyi angba nu ongwu nsɔdzɛ itsuutɔ di dzɛ oshishe gyegwu-gyegwu na, <verse eid="REV 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10"/>engyukwo osudenɛ ntona li tukwukɛ esɛ nu ongwu nsɔdzɛ itsuutɔ na, di sunu ongwu ndzɛ oshishe gyegwu-gyegwu nani. A li gbe okpapyi mgbi ama lakiyayi itsuutɔ si gbɛɛ:<verse eid="REV 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11"/>&lt;&lt;Abu mɛ, Otsɛ bɛyi Imgbasho mgbi eyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">ogbɛ okwɔkwɔ yi mmwɛ bɛyi mfye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">lubana abu ta alungwɔ duu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">ma mi oweka mgbi abu a ta ma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">di dzɛ mi odzɛɛdzɛ mgbi ama aani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 4:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Afɛ ofulu-fulu yi ongwummala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1"/>Nɛ ani di afɛ ofulu-fulu mi abugye mgbi ongwu nsɔdzɛ itsuutɔ nani, ngwi a lɔ ungwɔ mi ali agyan duu kye kwobɛ imbe egyafa. <verse eid="REV 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2"/>Ani diyɛ di ongyesɔ odatu le noola mi ela okwukwo gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li emɛ mɛ okye fwɛlu okwobɛ di kwulu afɛ na?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3"/>Nghaduu inggisɛ onyi mi esho naadi mi ɛsɛ hona mi ikpɛsɛ yagba okwulu afɛ na naadi winɛ di ifun kpaa ba, <verse eid="REV 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4"/>Ani tsukwu diyɛ tsukwu ikyekyɛ a tu inggisɛ onyi nka kwulu afɛ na hona winɛ di ifun ba. <verse eid="REV 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5"/>Nɛ engyukwo ntona onyi nya ani gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ka tsukwu ba! Dika, Ugaba mgbi etɔ mgbi emi iJuda, Etɔ mgbi iDevedi ngha wa. O ka yagba kwulu afɛ na yi okwobɛ-kwobɛ egyafa ntonani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6"/>Nɛ ani di Ongwummala, le dinɛ dafi a teyi ngwɔn mani, kwudzɛ mi idzidzɛ itsuutɔ, atta owamyɛ nghi enɛ bɛyi engyukwo ntona loka won. O dzɛ yi agbe nghi egyafa yi inɛ egyafa, ngwi li Onodzi egyafa mgbi Imgbasho ngwi a kye dɛsɔ nu ɛsɛ duu mani. <verse eid="REV 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7"/>O ba wa kye gbɛlu afɛ ofulu-fulu na mi abugye mgbi ongwu nsɔdzɛ itsuutɔ nani. <verse eid="REV 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8"/>Man ngwi o kye gbɛlu nɛ, atta owamyɛ nghi enɛ ntona bɛyi engyukwo osudenɛ ntona lakɛ esɛ mi iyayi Ongwummala nani. Ama duu dzɛ yi ozuna a di byi uga abashi nmbwo yi ungwɔ ogbungbɛ mi ifun, ngwi li ibɔ mgbi emi osaan. <verse eid="REV 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9"/>A di shashi ofufɛ gbɛɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">&lt;&lt;Abu mɛ okyi kyelu afɛ ofulu-fulu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">di kye kwulu okwobɛ-kwobɛ mgban ntonani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">ikyekyɛ a ngwɔ abu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">ma yi eyi mgbi abu, abu gya inggisɛ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">mi ali udzɛ bɛyi ondudzɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">bɛyi inggisɛ yi ɛsɛ duu ikye Imgbasho.<verse eid="REV 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10"/>Abu nu ma yɛɛ esutɔ bɛyi ama ofifɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:10">ikye osunu Imgbasho mgbi eyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:10">a dika kye ɛsɛ nɛ teyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11"/>Nɛ ani ndinɛ si fwo ela engyesɔ ibyibyi, mmbwo mgbi ama li idubu idubu, yi idubu iwyo akpe idubu iwyo. A kpakɛkɛ wo itsuutɔ bɛyi atta owamyɛ bɛyi engyukwo ntonani. <verse eid="REV 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12"/>Mi ela okwukwo a shashi gbɛɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">&lt;&lt;Omɛɛmɛ li Ongwummala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">ongwu a ngwɔn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">o kye gbɛlu mfye yi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">aludu yi ozoyeye yi ɛnɛpɛ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">yi mmwɛ yi okwɔkwɔ bɛyi otsɛɛtsɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13"/>Nɛ ani fwo ali atta mi esho duu bɛyi mi ɛsɛ nɛ bɛyi mi ikpɛsɛ bɛyi mi ekyoo okwukwo, bɛyi alungwɔ nto mboma duu, le shashi gbɛɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">Mbi ongwu nsɔdzɛ itsuutɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:13">yi mbi Ongwummala</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">ni otsɛɛtsɛ yi mmwɛ yi okwɔkwɔ bɛyi mfye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:13">dzɛ mbon, nghataa gyegwu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14"/>Adan owamyɛ nghi enɛ ntona gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;No dzɛ ngha,&gt;&gt; man engyukwo ntona lakɛ esɛ di sunu.<verse eid="REV 5:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Okwulu okwobɛ egyafa ntonani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1"/>Dafi ani di Ongwummala kwulu okwobɛ-kwobɛ ongwi ababɔ nɛ. Ani si fwo onyi mi idzidzɛ atta owamyɛ ntona gbɔ mi ela ngbela dafi akpala mani gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kwa!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2"/>Man ani ndinɛ si di mmya onzundzɛ dzɛ iyayi mbi ani! Inggisɛ nle tɔn ma byi uta, a di kye okpapyi nun, o tɔn tasɛ dafi inggisɛ onghaangha mani, le ka ngha. <verse eid="REV 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3"/>Onɔ ngwi Ongwummala kwulu okwobɛ na ongwu fan ma, ani fwo atta owamyɛ ntona ongwu fan gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kwa!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4"/>Nɛ mmya oka nma dafi ola tasɛ, inggisɛ nle tɔn ma, a nun gbɛɛ no kyi kyelu iyu mi ɛsɛ nɛni, odi nu inggisɛ kwobu ewoma. A kye okwusunkli ogbadaa nun.<verse eid="REV 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5"/>Onɔ ngwi Ongwummala kwulu okwobɛ na ongwu ta ma, ani fwo atta owamyɛ ntona ongwu ta gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kwa!&gt;&gt; Ani di mmya onbyinbyi kwudzɛ iyayi mbi ani! Inggisɛ nle tɔn ma, kye ungwɔ omba ungwɔ agya efa byabɔ. <verse eid="REV 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6"/>Ani fwo ungwɔ gbela dafi ela mi idzidzɛ mgbi atta owamyɛ ntonani. Le gbɛɛ, awu alakama onyi okpa mi ikye idɔ egbe onyi, awu enesɔ nghi eta okpa mi ikye idɔ egbe onyi, dika nu engyie yi eneekwɔ na nyanya ba!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7"/>Onɔ ngwi Ongwummala kye kwulu okwobɛ-kwobɛ ongwu nɛ ma, ani fwo ela mgbi atta owamyɛ ongwu nɛ le gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;kwa!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8"/>Ani ndinɛ, man mmya nsila kwudzɛ! Ongye otɔn ma a kwun di Ikwongye, ta Endzi kyan iyikpa kwɛkwɛ. A kye mfye nu ma gbɛɛ nu ma ngwɔ inggisɛ mi ayɛsɛ onyi mi idzidzɛ enɛ mgbi ɛsɛ yi okwusunkli yi onikyenbwa yi ootse, bɛyi mmbwaboshɛ emi ɛsɛ nɛni.<verse eid="REV 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9"/>Ngwi o kwulu okwobɛ-kwobɛ ongwu da ma, ani di oshishe mgbi ama ngwu a ngwɔ ikye elodzimgbasho ikyegbɛɛ a kyɔ obwɛndɛ otsitsi mi ita iwashi mani. <verse eid="REV 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10"/>A kwu ela mi ela okwukwo gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ka kye onɔ sinɛ, Otsɛ Ongha yi mfye, osaan yi otsitsi, se ngwi abu ka fwo inggisɛ emi ɛsɛ nɛ ikwɔ di kpa ma mkpa mi ikye eyi mgbi eyi ngwi a kye kyi esɛ na?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11"/>Ta a nu ma angwuto onzundzɛ di nya ma gbɛɛ nu ma mbata gwee, nghataa ni umbwo engbidɔ angbeka bɛyi emi ongwunɔ ma ama ngwu a ka ngwɔ ma dafi ama abuoma kpaa a ngwɔ ma ma mbwumbwo se.<verse eid="REV 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12"/>N di dafi o kwulu okwobɛ-kwobɛ ongwu gyin na mani. Man ikpɛsɛ suusu kpakpa. Onɔ kyata yɛɛ onbyinbyi dafi ishisha angwuto ngwi a mɛ mi andu mndɔ mani, ofyia olɔlɔ kyata yɛɛ omuma dafi eyi, <verse eid="REV 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13"/>man mcɛ mi akpa yangwuta luba esɛ, dafi onggangga mgbi andundu li wulɔ onɔ ngwi awo fa fyumfye nani. <verse eid="REV 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14"/>Man esho byakpa byulu dafi afɛ ngwi a fulu mani, nɛ ali unggwɔ yi ibu duu a kye kwɔlu ma mi imbe mgbi ama.<verse eid="REV 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15"/>Ta utɔ emi ɛsɛ nɛ, utɔ engyaa, emi agyegika, emi aludu, ama odatu, yi ali ofyɛɛ bɛyi inggisɛ ɛwɛwɛ duu gbe ewoma da mi ishɛ bɛyi ifo unggwɔ. <verse eid="REV 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16"/>A kwu unggwɔ yi akwutsɛ ela gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Yulu tukwu eyi kye eyi da mi inɛ mgbi ongwu nsɔdzɛ itsuutɔ bɛyi itingga mgbi Ongwummala! <verse eid="REV 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17"/>Ikyesinɛ egbe itingga mgbi ama okwulewo ma ba wa, nghanɛ li emɛ ka tsigɛgɛ yan gbɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 6:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Inggisɛ idubu ideli onyi <optbreak/> ngwusefa dɔn enɛ <optbreak/> ngwu a kye ambɛ dzɛ ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1"/>Ngwi ungwɔnɛ wa nyɛ nɛ, ani di engyesɔ nghi enɛ kwudzɛ ayɛ enɛ mgbi ɛsɛ le kwulu awo mi ayɛ enɛ mgbi ɛsɛ gbɛɛ no ka fa mi ikpɛsɛ naa mi ekyoo okwukwo hona mi ekwɔ onyi kpaa ba. <verse eid="REV 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2"/>Nɛ ani di ongyesɔ oka tɔkyɛ mi onosa, yi ambɛ mgbi Imgbasho oshishe. O kwu ela mi ela okwukwo kɛ mbi engyesɔ nghi enɛ ama ngwu a teyi kye mfye nu ma gbɛɛ nu ma dzili ɛsɛ bɛyi ekyoo okwukwo ntona gbɛɛ: <verse eid="REV 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3"/>&lt;&lt;Ka dzili ɛsɛ naa ekyoo okwukwo hona ekwɔ ba, nghataa ni eyi kye ambɛ dzɛ engbidɔ mgbi Imgbasho mgbi eyi mi ebeshu se.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4"/>Nɛman ani fwo mmbwo mgbi ama ngwu a kye ambɛ dzɛ ma mani: Idubu ideli onyi ngwusefa dɔn enɛ mi ali agwɔ mgbi iSrai duu.<verse eid="REV 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5"/>Mi agwɔ mgbi iJuda a kye ambɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:5">dzɛ inggisɛ idubu iwyodefa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:5">mi agwɔ mgbi iRubɛn idubu iwyodefa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:5">mi agwɔ mgbi iGadi idubu iwyodefa,<verse eid="REV 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6"/>mi agwɔ mgbi Ashɛ idubu iwyodefa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:6">mi agwɔ mgbi iNaftali idubu iwyodefa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:6">mi agwɔ mgbi iManase</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:6">idubu iwyodefa,<verse eid="REV 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7"/>mi agwɔ mgbi iSimiɔn idubu iwyodefa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:7">mi agwɔ mgbi iLevi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:7">idubu iwyodefa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:7">mi agwɔ mgbi iSaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:7">idubu iwyodefa,<verse eid="REV 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8"/>mi agwɔ mgbi iDzebulun idubu iwyodefa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:8">mi agwɔ mgbi iJose idubu iwyodefa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:8">mi agwɔ mgbi iBenjamin idubu iwyodefa.<verse eid="REV 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibyi inggisɛ ama nwo angwuto <optbreak/> onzundzɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9"/>Ngwi ungwɔnɛ wa nyɛ nɛ, ani di ibyi inggisɛ mi iyayi mbi ani ngwu inggisɛ onyi ka gbɔ ma gbɛ ba, kyɛ mi ali ɛsɛ yi agwɔ yi inggisɛ yi ondudzɛ duu, gbeka kwudzɛ iyayi itsuutɔ bɛyi iyayi Ongwummala. A wo angwuto onzundzɛ di byi abade mi abɔ mgbi ama. <verse eid="REV 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10"/>A si kwu ela mi ela okwukwo gbɛɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:10">&lt;&lt;Owatɔ-watɔ kyɛ mbi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:10">Imgbasho mgbi eyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:10">Ongwu nsɔdzɛ itsuutɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:10">bɛyi mbi Ongwummala.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11"/>Engyesɔ ntona duu kwudzɛkɛ kpakɛkɛ wo itsuutɔ di kpatsɛ engyukwo ntona yi atta owamyɛ ntonani. A tukwukɛ esɛ gbe ikye wɛɛsɛ mi iyayi itsuutɔ si sunu Imgbasho, <verse eid="REV 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12"/>le gbɛɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">&lt;&lt;No dzɛ ngha!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:12">Otsɛ-tsɛ yi okwɔkwɔ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">yi ozoyeye yi angba yi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:12">mmwɛ yi mfye yi apa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">no dzɛ mbi Imgbasho mgbi eyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:12">nghataa imbisɔ gyegwu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">No dzɛ ngha!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13"/>Nɛ onyi mbi engyukwo ntonɛ byi ani ita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ama nwo angwuto onzundzɛ ntonɛ ma, a li ele, a di kyɛ ole kyɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14"/>Ani si nu uka gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ongyukwo, abu ye.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 7:14">Ta o gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ntonɛ li ama ntasɛ mi adzɛ okwukwo nani; a kye salu angwuto mgbi ama non yɛɛ onzundzɛ mi eyi mgbi Ongwummala. <verse eid="REV 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15"/>Ikyenghanɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:15">&lt;&lt;a to iyayi itsuutɔ mgbi Imgbasho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:15">dile sunun onɔ yi otu mi ozu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:15">mgban okwukwo nani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:15">man ongwu nsɔdzɛ itsuutɔ na ka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:15">kye iwulu abɔ mgban tukwu ma.<verse eid="REV 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16"/>Akponyi kpaa enbwa ka dɔ ma ba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:16">ekweni kpaa dika kwu ma ba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:16">Onɔ ka tsɛ ma ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:16">naadi olola onyi kpaa ba.<verse eid="REV 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17"/>Ikyesinɛ Ongwummala ndzɛ mi idzidzɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:17">itsuutɔ na ka li inggisɛ ongyo ma;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:17">o ka gbe ma teyi lu mi uteeni oshishe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:17">Man Imgbasho ka fɔ ma etse inɛ duu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 7:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8"/>
  <para style="s1">A kwulu afɛ ngwi a kye kwobɛ na <optbreak/> ongwu gyafa mani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1"/>Ngwi Ongwummala kye afɛ ngwi a kyi kwobɛ ongwu gyafa kye kwulu nɛ, esho dede mɛ itsitsi obyi hini. <verse eid="REV 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2"/>Man ani di engyesɔ nghi egyafa nkwudzɛ to inai Imgbasho na, a kye agba onyonyi nu ma kpatsɛ.<verse eid="REV 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3"/>Ongyesɔ oka, nbyi uga abashi mgbi ungwɔ ogbungbɛ ma, ba wa kwudzɛkɛ iwashi. Ongwunɛ nɛ a kye ungwɔ ogbungbɛ kpakpa nun ikye okye toola yi ibɔ mgbi emi osaan mi iwashi abashi mi iyayi itsuutɔ. <verse eid="REV 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4"/>Nɛ iwu mgbi ungwɔ ogbungbɛ na, bɛkɛ yi ibɔ mgbi emi osaan, kyɛɛ mi abɔ mgbi ongyesɔ na, lu iyayi Imgbasho.<verse eid="REV 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5"/>Ta ongyesɔ na kyi kyelu uga ungwɔ ogbungbɛ na, mwa ola mi iwashi mbwokɛ ele, man kye ngwuta lakɛ esɛ; ta imbe kwadu, akpala gbo, mmbwo naabɔ, ɛsɛ di suusu.<verse eid="REV 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Agba ntonani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6"/>Nɛ engyesɔ nghi egyafa ndzɛ yi agba nghi egyafa ntona wewo ofo ma.<verse eid="REV 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7"/>Ongyesɔ ongwu ababɔ fo agba mgban, ta mmbwakwutsɛ yi ola ngwuɛkɛ yi eyi, man a kye ma ngwuta luba esɛ. Ayɛsɛ ongwu ta gyola, ayɛ ekwɔ ongwu ta gyola, oshɛ okyinda duu di gyola.<verse eid="REV 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8"/>Ongyesɔ ongwu fan fo agba mgban, man a kye ungwɔ dafi unggwɔ ogbagbadzidzi, nle gbɛ yi ola ngwuta wokɛ onekyoo. Man ayɛ ongwu ta mgbi onekyoo ma yɛɛ eyi, <verse eid="REV 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9"/>ta ungwɔ ama ndzɛ yi oshishe nwoto onekyoo mi ayɛ ongwu ta duu kwulu, a kye iwudza eni mi ayɛsɛ ongwu ta duu, kye sulu.<verse eid="REV 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10"/>Nɛ ongyesɔ ongwu ta fo agba mgban, man mcɛ okwulewo, nkwiinɛ dafi itɔci sini, ngwuta kyɛ esho wa gyɛkɛ okwokyiikwokyi mgbi ekyoo mi ayɛ ongwu ta bɛyi eni mgbi oshishe nani. <verse eid="REV 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11"/>Iyi mcɛ na gbɛɛ Onunɔ. Ayɛ eni ongwu ta na yɛ nunɔ, nɛ ibyi inggisɛ ama nweni onunɔ na duu kwulu.<verse eid="REV 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12"/>Ongyesɔ ongwu nɛ fo agba mgban, ta a kyi kwɔdzɛ ayɛ ongwu ta mgbi onɔ yi ofyia bɛyi mcɛ, man a yɛɛ iifu. Nghanɛ ayɛ ongwu ta mgbi onɔ yi otu duu dzɛ yi osa wuba.<verse eid="REV 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13"/>Ngwi ani le kyidi nɛ, ani fwo uyɛɛ le bulu mi idzidzɛ awo kwu ela mi ela okwukwo gbɛɛ: &lt;&lt;Ibli! Ibli! Ibli mbi imba mgbi ɛsɛ nɛni, mi ikye agba ngwi engyesɔ angbeka eta ntona le wewo ofo mani!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 8:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1"/>Ngwi ongyesɔ ongwu da fo agba mgban nɛ, ani di mcɛ ngwuta mi esho luba esɛ. A kye ungwɔ okwulu ishɛ ndondu ba na nu mcɛ nani. <verse eid="REV 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2"/>Onɔ ngwi o kyi kwulu ishɛ na ma, iwu kyɛɛ mi ele dafi iwu mgbi ola okwukwo mani. Iwu na nu onɔ yi akpesho duu yifu. <verse eid="REV 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3"/>Man obagidi tɔ mi iwu na kpatsɛ ɛsɛ a di kye mfye nu ma dafi itɔ mfye mgbi mnaa ongwi ɛsɛ nɛni. <verse eid="REV 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4"/>A nya ma gbɛɛ nu ma ka kyɔ oshɛ mi ɛsɛ naadi afutse onyi hona ekwɔ unkonyi ba, kpaa li inggisɛ ama ndzɛ yi ambɛ mgbi Imgbasho mi ebeshu mgbi ama ba mata. <verse eid="REV 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5"/>A nu ma mfye gbɛɛ nu ma ngwɔ inggisɛ ba, kpaa li onu ma isɔ mi ofyia eda kyoon. Ma Isɔ ngwi a gye ma di dzɛ dafi otooto mgbi mnaa onɔ ngwi i to inggisɛ mani. <verse eid="REV 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6"/>Mi egbe ntona ma, inggisɛ ka pita ikwongye, kpaa a ka dun ba; a dika mina okwulu, nghaduu ikwongye ka tsinya dzamata.<verse eid="REV 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7"/>Obagidi ntona to dafi mmya ngwi a mɛ ma ewo ika mani. A kye ungwɔ wo ma mi ikye dafi akata abashi mani, inɛ mgbi ama lu inɛ inggisɛ owamyɛ. <verse eid="REV 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8"/>Otu mgbi ama dzɛ dafi otu mgbi engyaa, aba mgbi ama di dzɛ dafi aba ugaba. <verse eid="REV 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9"/>A dzɛ yi okpalika ndzɛ dafi okpalika ashashi mani, ma adu mgbi asha mgbi ama dzɛ dafi akpala ogboogbo mgbi mmya bɛyi mmyikwukwɔ ibyibyi nkwadu tole kɛ ika mani. <verse eid="REV 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10"/>A dzɛ yi odu di li to dafi mnaa mani, ma mi odu mgbi ama, a dzɛ yi mfye onu inggisɛ isɔ mi ofyia eda. <verse eid="REV 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11"/>A dzɛ yi utɔ nkye ma le teyi, ongyesɔ ongwu ishɛ ndondu ba nani, ongwu iyin mi ondu iHibru li Abadɔn, mi ondu iGriki li Apoliɔn (Ongye odzili).<verse eid="REV 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12"/>Ibli ongwi ababɔ nyɛ waali; ibli angbeka nghi efa ka kyɛ iyikpa ma.<verse eid="REV 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13"/>Ongyesɔ ongwu gyin fo agba mgban, man ani fwo ela tɔkyɛ mi okoko enɛ mgbi iwashi abashi ndzɛ iyayi Imgbasho nani. <verse eid="REV 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14"/>Ela na gbɔ yi ongyesɔ ongwu gyin ndzɛ yi agba na gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kye shɛlu engyesɔ enɛ ngwu a bwa ma adi mi ekyoo okwulewo mgbi iYufreti nani.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15"/>Man engyesɔ enɛ ngwu a teyi kye ma dzɛkɛ le fɛ obyi nɛ yɛyɛ yi egbe yi ofyia bɛyi onova ma, a shɛ ma ta gbɛɛ nu ma ngwɔ inggisɛ onyi ikye eta mani. <verse eid="REV 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16"/>Ani fwo mmbwo oblakwutsɛ ama ndɔto mmya ma li imiliɔn ideli efa.<verse eid="REV 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17"/>Mmya yi ama otɔ ma ngwu ani di mi inɛ odiidi ma to ngha aani: Okpalika mgbi ama pita wo omuma, onbyinbyi vluvlu yɛ wo omuma dafi ofufu odaka mani. Ikye mmya ntona lu ikye ugaba, mi ondu mgbi ama ola, iwu bɛyi ofufu odaka le tɔ mi ele. <verse eid="REV 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18"/>A ngwɔ inggisɛ onyi ikye eta ma yi isɔ eta ntonɛni: Ola, iwu, bɛyi ola ofufu odaka nle tɔ mi ondu mgbi mmya ntona mani. <verse eid="REV 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19"/>Mfye mgbi mmya ntona dzɛ mi ondu bɛyi mi odu mgbi ama; ikyesinɛ odu mgbi ama dzɛ dafi ifa, ndzɛ yi ikye li laaba mani.<verse eid="REV 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20"/>Inggisɛ owamyɛ ama nsisi ngwu isɔ ntonɛ ngwɔ ma ba ma, di kyatitukwu mi ungwɔ ibwubwe ngwi a le kyɔ ba kpɔɔ; a nya osunu emɛsɛ ba, yi adagyɛ abashi, iyudza onzundzɛ okwɔkwɔ, itigbla, ikwutsɛ yi ekwɔ ikwukwɔ ngwi ka di naadi fwo hona kyikyɛ ba na ba. <verse eid="REV 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21"/>Naadi a nya yi inggisɛ ongwɔɔngwɔ yi obudei okyɔɔkyɔ yi amah hona mmyi mgbi ama oyiiyi kpaa ba.<verse eid="REV 9:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Ongyesɔ yi ongwaafɛ ofulu-fulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1"/>Nɛ ani di ongyesɔ oka odatu kyɛ esho le ba esɛ. A tukwun yi akpa, mmbwo di lowa nyan ikye mi esho; inɛ mgban kwɔ dafi onɔ mani, afɔ mgban di dzɛ dafi otlɛsɛ ola. <verse eid="REV 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2"/>O kye ongwaafɛ ofulu-fulu nlasisa byabɔ. O kye afɔ mgban abugye tuokɛ mi onekyoo yi afɔ mgban abubɛ mi esɛ, <verse eid="REV 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3"/>man o si feela okwukwo dafi agwudu otsɛɛtsɛ mgbi ugaba mani. Onɔ ngwi o feela mata, ela mgbi akpala egyafa ntona sandu. <verse eid="REV 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4"/>Ngwi akpala egyafa sandu nɛ, ani wewo okyi lɔlu; nghaduu ani fwo ela mi esho gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kye odzɛ ngwi akpala egyafa ntona gbɔ na da dika kye lɔlu wokɛ esɛ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5"/>Nɛ ongyesɔ ongwu ani teyi din kye afɔ kwudzɛ onekyoo yi esɛ na, kyile abugye mgban lu esho. <verse eid="REV 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6"/>Man o fa mbi ongwu ndzɛ oshishe nghataa gyegwu nani, ongwu nta esho yi esɛ yi onekyoo bɛyi ungwɔ ama nto mboma duu, di gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Onɔ ombeembe ka dzɛma wuba! <verse eid="REV 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7"/>Nghaduu mi egbe ngwi ongyesɔ ongwu gyafa ka wewo ofo agba mgban ma, ungwɔ odaada mgbi Imgbasho ka mbwumbwo, yɛyɛ dafi o teyi noola nya engbidɔ mgban ama ogbɛɛsɛ mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8"/>Nɛ ela ngwi ani teyi fwo mi esho na diyɛ gbɔdzɛ yi ani kpɔɔ gbɛɛ: &lt;&lt;Lu, ka kyi gbɛlu afɛ ofulu-fulu nlasisa mi abɔ ongyesɔ nkwudzɛ mi onekyoo bɛyi esɛ nani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9"/>Nghanɛ ani kɛ mbi ongyesɔ na ka nyan gbɛɛ non kye ongwaafɛ ofulu-fulu na nu ani. O nya ani gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Gbɛ di kye gye. Ka nu ifu mgbi abu maama, kpaa ka fyumfya mi ondu mgbi abu dafi enewo mani.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10"/>Ani kye gbɛlu afɛ ofulu-fulu ongbungbɛ mi abɔ ongyesɔ na kye gye. I fyumfya mi ondu mgbi ani dafi enewo mani, kpaa ngwi ani kye gye mbe nɛ, ifu mgbi ani yɛ maama. <verse eid="REV 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11"/>Ta a nya ani gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Abu ka yegbɔ kyɛmɛ mi ikye inggisɛ ibyibyi, emi ɛsɛ yi ondudzɛ bɛyi emi utɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 10:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Obwɛndɛ efa ntonani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1"/>Ta a kye agida ndzɛ dafi ashi omba ungwɔ mani kye nu ani: di nya ani gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Lu ka kye mbalu ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho, bɛyi iwashi, di kye gbɔlu mmbwo inggisɛ ama nle sunu mi ele duu. <verse eid="REV 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2"/>Kpaa ka mba ifyudɛ ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho na ba, dzanta dzɛkɛ, ikyekyɛ a kye nu Udzengye ntonani: a dika kyɔ itukwu ma mi ogalu osaan mi onova eta yi ofyia egyin. <verse eid="REV 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3"/>Man ani ka kye mfye nu obwɛndɛ mgbi ani nghi efa ntonani, a ka kye angwuto ikwu wo di yegbɔ esɔ mgbi Imgbasho mi onova eta yi ofyia egyin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4"/>Obwɛndɛ efa ntonɛ li ekwɔ olivi nghi efa mani, bɛyi akoola nghi efa nkwoto iyayi Otsɛ Imgbasho mgbi ɛsɛ nɛni. <verse eid="REV 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5"/>Ma ali inggisɛ nmina okyɔ ma ungwɔ yɔ, ola li tɔ mi ondu mgbi ama kye ma gye: li itɔ ofɛ ngwi ali inggisɛ nmina okyɔ ma ungwɔ duu ka kwulu joani. <verse eid="REV 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6"/>A dzɛ yi mfye okye esho tukwu, gbɛɛ ni mmbwo ka kya ba, mi egbe ngwi ama le gbeesɔ mgbi Imgbasho mani. A di dzɛ yi mfye okyata eni yɛɛ eyi, odi nu ali itɔ isɔ okwulewo, alonɔ ngwi a mina duu. <verse eid="REV 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7"/>Onɔ ngwi a ngyɛlu obwɛndɛ mgbi ama ma, mmbwaba ongwi ntɔ mi ishɛ odondu ba na ka gblika yi ama, di ngha ma yi mfye di ngwɔ ma. <verse eid="REV 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8"/>Ikwɔ mgbi ama ka tila la ingɔfɛ mgbi ongbodzi ogalu, ngwi a li kwu mi ambɛ gbɛɛ, iSodon yi Igyibiti, imbe ngwi a kye Otsɛ mgbi ama kpaa gbokwo ekwatsi nani. <verse eid="REV 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9"/>Mi egbe eta dɔ itsitsi, ali inggisɛ mi agwɔ, ondudzɛ, yi ɛsɛ ka kyidi ikwɔ mgbi ama kpaa ka fwa gbɛɛ ni a ka kye ma ndzi ba. <verse eid="REV 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10"/>Imba mgbi ɛsɛ ka tsatsa mi ikye ma, di gha ewoma umba, ikyekyɛ oyegbɔ efa ntonɛ nu ɛsɛ isɔ.<verse eid="REV 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11"/>Kpaa ngwi i wa nyɛ egbe eta yi itsi nɛ, mmyɛ kyɛ mbi Imgbasho wa kaka ma, man a kyato dzɛkunto, idzidzi si kwulu ama ndi mani. <verse eid="REV 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12"/>Ta oyegbɔ efa ntona fwo ela okwukwo kyɛ esho le nya ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Luba esho na.&gt;&gt; Ngwi a le lu esho nɛ, engyikyili mgbi ama tokɛ le di ma.<verse eid="REV 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13"/>Mi obyi na yɛyɛ ɛsɛ suusu man onyi mi ikye iwyo mgbi ogalu na dzili. Inggisɛ kwulu idubu egyafa mi ɛsɛ osuusu nani, nɛ i kwulu ama nwatɔ ma ewo, a di kye oshewo nu Imgbasho ongwi esho.<verse eid="REV 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14"/>Ibli ongwu fan nyɛ waali; ongwu ta kyɛma dzikan-dzikan.<verse eid="REV 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Agba ongwu gyafa mani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15"/>Ongyesɔ ongwu gyafa fo agba mgban, man ela ama okwukwo tɔ mi esho le gbɛɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:15">&lt;&lt;Esutɔ ongwi ɛsɛ yɛɛ esutɔ mgbi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:15">Otsɛ mgbi eyi yi iKrestu mgban,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:15">o dika kyuutɔ nghataa imbise gyegwu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16"/>Man engyukwo nghi osudenɛ, ama nsɔto itsuutɔ mgbi ama mi inai Imgbasho ma tukwukɛ kye ikye wɛɛsɛ di sunu Imgbasho. <verse eid="REV 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17"/>A le gbɛɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">&lt;&lt;Eyi ta abu angba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">Otsɛ Imgbasho onghaangha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">Ongwu ndzɛ onɛnɛ di teyi dzɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">ikyekyɛ abu kyi kyelu mfye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">mgbi abu okwulewo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">di wita okyuutɔ.<verse eid="REV 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18"/>Ɛsɛ gbeka buntse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">ikyekyɛ onɔ itingga mgbi abu gyɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">Onɔ gyɔ ogbɔ emi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">ikwukwɔ ikwɔ wa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">odi nu engbidɔ mgbi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">abu ama ogbɛɛsɛ umba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">bɛyi emi osaan mgbi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">abu yi ama nsunu iyi mgbi abu mani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">ama ongbungbɛ yi ama nshewo duu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">odi dzili ama ndzili ɛsɛ mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19"/>Ta a kwulu ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho mi esho, man mi idzidzɛ ozu okwukwo osunun na, a di imu mgbi ondu odzɛɛdzɛ mgban. Man mmbwo naabɔ ba, imbe le kwadu, akpala le gbo, ɛsɛ le suusu, mmbwo akwutsɛ okwulewo di kya.<verse eid="REV 11:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Ongyaa na bɛyi Ozumenyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1"/>Ambɛ okwukwo okwulewo tɔ mi esho: ongyaa kye onɔ wo ewo dafi angwuto, yi ofyia mi atafɔ mgban bɛyi okpapyi mcɛ iwyodefa mi ikye mbon. <verse eid="REV 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2"/>O dzɛ yi ifewo nɛ imba ogboogbo yi owulewo mgbi imba non makwɔ tɔ dafi o le mbongwɛ mani. <verse eid="REV 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3"/>Nɛ ambɛ oka di tɔ mi esho: ozumenyi omuma okwukwo ndzɛ yi ikye nghi egyafa yi agbe nghi iwyo bɛyi okpapyi egyafa mi ikye mbon. <verse eid="REV 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4"/>Odu mgban kye fyalu onyi mi ikye eta mgbi mcɛ di kye ma ngwuta luba ɛsɛ. Ozumenyi na kwulɛsɛ dzɛkiyayi ongyaa nle gblimba nani, ikyegbɛɛ ni ongwu kye ongwɛ na gye mi onɔ ngwi o mba yɔ. <verse eid="REV 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5"/>O mba ongwongyulɔ, nka kye ɛsɛ duu teyi yi okwuta utɔ ashashi. A kye lafwan ongwɛ lu mbi Imgbasho ka sɔkɛ itsuutɔ mgban. <verse eid="REV 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6"/>Ongyaa na si tsinya lu okwɛsɛ mi imbe ngwi Imgbasho mɛ dzankɛ ngwi a ka gbɛwɛbyin ofyia ngwusefa dɔn efa mani.<verse eid="REV 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7"/>Man ika kyɛɛ mi esho. IMaikye yi engyesɔ mgban gblika yi ozumenyi nani, ozumenyi yi engyesɔ mgban kpaa di gblika yi ama. <verse eid="REV 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8"/>Kpaa ozumenyi fyumfye mɛ ba, man a dzɛ yi imbe mi esho wuba. <verse eid="REV 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9"/>A kye andɛfɛ ozumenyi na ngwuta luba esɛ, ifa tugbe ngwi a kwun di olodu hona iSatan, nkye ɛsɛ duu wɛndɛ nani. A kyon ngwuta luba ɛsɛ yi engyesɔ mgban.<verse eid="REV 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10"/>Nɛ ani fwo ela okwukwo mi esho gbɛɛ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 12:10">&lt;&lt;Onɛnɛ owatɔ-watɔ yi mfye yi esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho mgbi eyi, yi mfye mgbi iKrestu mgban ba wa. Ikyekyɛ ongwu nle du ongwufabɔ mbi emi ongwuneyi nya Imgbasho onɔ yi otu ma, a kyon ngwuta luba esɛ wa.<verse eid="REV 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11"/>A nghan mi eyi mgbi Ongwummala bɛyi elodzɛ mgbi ama okyɔ obwɛndɛ mani; a di oshishe mgbi ewoma kpa ma itukwu nyɛsɛ ba, nghanɛ a kye onbukwɔ nu eba.<verse eid="REV 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12"/>Nghanɛ ema ama nto esho tsatsa na!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 12:12">Kpaa ahoo mbi ɛsɛ bɛyi onekyoo, ikyekyɛ olodu lu esɛ mbi ema!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 12:12">O mbwo yi itingga, ikyekyɛ o ye gbɛɛ onɔ mgban le gbu ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13"/>Onɔ ngwi ozumenyi difwi gbɛɛ a kye ongwu ngwuta luba ɛsɛ nɛ, o si wita olɔ ongyaa nmba ongwongyulɔ na onya. <verse eid="REV 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14"/>A kye asha mgbi uyɛɛ okwukwo nghi efa nu ongyaa na, ikyegbɛɛ non bulu lu okwɛsɛ mi imbe ngwi a mɛ dzɛkɛ ikyon nani, imbe ngwi a ka gbekabyin mi onova eta dɔ itsitsi, ngwi ozumenyi na ka to gbɛ ba mani. <verse eid="REV 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15"/>Nɛ ifa na tuyɛ eni mi ondu mgban dafi ekyoo mani lukwu ongyaa nani, ikye ni eni gben lu. <verse eid="REV 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16"/>Nghaduu ikpɛsɛ ya ongyaa na abɔ okwulu ondu mgban kye ekyoo ngwi ifa na tuyɛ mi ondu na mbe. <verse eid="REV 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17"/>Ta ozumenyi si kyitingga kpakpa yi ongyaa nani. Nghanɛ o wuta ika yi etɔ mgban ama nsisi duu. Ama nsunu ola mgbi Imgbasho di kwudzɛkɛ mi obwɛndɛ mgbi iYesu mani. <verse eid="REV 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 12:18"/>Man ozumenyi na si kwudzɛkɛ mfyan mi onekyoo.<verse eid="REV 12:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Mmbwaba efa ntonani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1"/>Ta ozumenyi na tɔ mi ekyoo dɔkɛ mfyan. Ani di di mmbwaba tɔkyɛ onekyoo. O dzɛ yi agbe nghi iwyo bɛyi ikye egyafa, yi okpapyi iwyo mi agbe mgban ntonani, ma mi ali ikye mgban duu, o dzɛ yi iyi ofya Imgbasho ito mi ele. <verse eid="REV 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2"/>Mmbwaba ngwi ani di ma lu ishafwan, kpaa o dzɛ yi afɔ dafi afɔ mgbi mndi di dzɛ yi ondu itɔ mgbi ugaba mani. Ozumenyi na kye ɛnɛpɛ mgban nu mmbwaba na yi itsuutɔ bɛyi mfye okwulewo. <verse eid="REV 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3"/>I dzɛ dafi ikye mgbi mmbwaba na oka dzɛ yi ifwa okwukwo mi ele, nghaduu ifwa na myɛ. Nɛ i kwulu ɛsɛ duu ewo man a kyɛdɔ mmbwaba nani. <verse eid="REV 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4"/>Inggisɛ duu sunu ozumenyi na ikyekyɛ o kye mfye nu mmbwaba nani, a sunu mmbwaba na di byita gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Li emɛ gyɔ yi mmbwaba nɛ? Li emɛ ka kye afɔ twɛsɛ gblika yan gbɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5"/>A nu mmbwaba na ondu ogbɔ elodzɛ mgbi ewo okyile esho yi ito ofya Imgbasho, odi kyɔ mfye mgban mi egbe idubu onyi, ideli efa yi ngwuseta. <verse eid="REV 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6"/>O kwulu ondu ofya Imgbasho ito, di mben iyi, yi imbe ngwi o dzɛ bɛyi ama nto esho duu. <verse eid="REV 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7"/>A nun mfye ogblika yi emi osaan di ngha ma. A di nun mfye mi ikye ali udzɛ, inggisɛ, ondudzɛ bɛyi ɛsɛ duu. <verse eid="REV 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8"/>Ama ngwu a lɔ ma iyi mi afɛ mgbi Ongwummala duuse ni a ta ɛsɛ ba duu, ka sunu mmbwaba nani.<verse eid="REV 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9"/>Inggisɛ ndzɛ yi adɔ yɔ, no fwo.<verse eid="REV 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10"/>Inggisɛ ama ndzɛ gbɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 13:10">a ka kwu ma ofyɛɛ yɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 13:10">li ofyɛɛ ngwi a ka kwu ma.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 13:10">Ama ndzɛ mbisɔ a ka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 13:10">ngwɔ yi okwusunkli yɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 13:10">li mi okwusunkli ngwi a ka ngwɔ ma.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 13:10">Ungwɔnɛ mina onyɔtsɛ okwu-kwu yi itukwu oshiishi bɛyi okwudzɛ mi otsitsi mi ayɛ mgbi emi osaan.<verse eid="REV 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmbwaba ntɔ mi ikpɛsɛ mani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11"/>Nɛ ani di mmbwaba oka, tɔkyɛ ikpɛsɛ. O dzɛ yi agbe nghi efa dafi ongwummala, kpaa o gbɔdzɛ dafi ozumenyi mani. <verse eid="REV 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12"/>O li kyɔ ali mfye mgbi mmbwaba ongwi ababɔ na duu gbikyon, di li nu ɛsɛ yi ama nto ele duu sunu mmbwaba ongwi ababɔ, ongwu ifwa mgban okwukwo myɛ nani. <verse eid="REV 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13"/>O di kyɔ ambɛ ama okwulewo ogbagbadzidzi, onoola tɔ mi esho ba esɛ ni inggisɛ duu di. <verse eid="REV 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14"/>Mi ikye ambɛ ama ngwi a nun mfye gbɛɛ non kyɔ gbikye mmbwaba ongwu ababɔ nɛ, o kpagya inggisɛ ama nto ɛsɛ nɛ wo. O wo ma ola gbɛɛ nu ma tuo adagyɛ ikye okye mmwɛ nu mmbwaba ongwu ma tanmmya yi okwusunkli kpa ka dzɛ oshishe nani. <verse eid="REV 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15"/>A nun mfye okye mmyɛ wo adagyɛ mgbi mmbwaba ongwi ababɔ nani, ikyegbɛɛ non gbɔdzɛ odi ngwɔ ama nfwa osunu adagyɛ na mani. <verse eid="REV 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16"/>O di si ali inggisɛ duu, ama ogyɛngyɛ yi ama oshewo, emi aludu bɛyi emi adzɛ, ama nbyabɔ ewoma bɛyi ofyɛɛ, gbɛɛ nu ma gbɛ ambɛ mi abugye hona ebeshu mgbi ama, <verse eid="REV 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17"/>ikyegbɛɛ ni inggisɛ onyi kpaa ka gya ungwɔ hona kye ungwɔ gya ba, sede non dzɛ yi ambɛ, ngwi li iyi mgbi mmbwaba na naadi mmbwo ngbikye iyi mgban mani.<verse eid="REV 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18"/>Ungwɔnɛ mina ozoyeye. Inggisɛ ndzɛ yi inɛ odiidi yɔ, no kye gbɔlu mmbwo mgbi mmbwaba ntonɛni, ikyesinɛ li ambɛ mgbi inggisɛ. Ambɛ mgban li egyin egyin egyin.<verse eid="REV 13:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Ongwummala yi emi idubu ideli onyi <optbreak/> ngwusefa dɔn enɛ ntonani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1"/>Nɛ ani ndinɛ, ta mi iyayi mbi ani Ongwummala dzɛ, kwudzɛkɛ Unggwɔ iDzayɔn, ama nto biyan li ama ngwu a lɔ iyi mgban bɛyi Otsɔn mi ebeshu mboma mani. <verse eid="REV 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2"/>Man ani fwo adu kyɛ esho dzɛ dafi agwudu mgbi eni ofɛ-fɛ bɛyi adu mgbi akpala okwukwo. Adu ngwi ani fwo ma dzɛ dafi mgbi ama ogbla ozuna le gbla ozuna mgbi ama mani. <verse eid="REV 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3"/>Ta a shashi ofufɛ mi iyayi itsuutɔ yi atta owamyɛ nghi enɛ bɛyi engyukwo ntonani. Inggisɛ onyi kpaa yagba kpayi ashi ma ba, sede li inggisɛ idubu ideli onyi ngwusefa dɔn enɛ ngwu a dulu ma watɔ mi ɛsɛ ma ta. <verse eid="REV 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4"/>Ntonɛ li ama nmbe ewoma yi engyaa ba mani, lubana a kye ewoma dzɛ saan. A li kyɛdɔ Ongwummala ali imbe ngwi o kɛ duu. A gya ma gyaagya mi idzidzɛ inggisɛ di kye ma fifɛ nu Imgbasho bɛyi Ongwummala dafi ungwogye ofufɛ mani. <verse eid="REV 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5"/>A fwo onya omwaamwa mi ondu mgbi ama ye ba; a dzɛ yi obube ba.<verse eid="REV 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Esɔ mgbi engyesɔ eta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6"/>Nɛ ani di ongyesɔ oka le bulu mi esho, o dzɛ yi esɔ mgbi oshishe gyegwu ogbɔɔgbɔ ndzɛ mi ikye mgbi inggisɛ ama nto ɛsɛ nɛni, yi agwɔ yi ondudzɛ bɛyi ali inggisɛ duu. <verse eid="REV 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7"/>O gbɔ mi ela okwukwo gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Mio Imgbasho di kye okwɔkwɔ nun na, ikyesinɛ obyi mgban ogbiikwɔ ma gyɔ wa. Sunu ongwu nta esho yi esɛ, onekyoo bɛyi imbe eni le lu nani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8"/>Ongyesɔ ongwu fan kyɛdɔ di gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Angbodzi iBabyilon bulu wa, nɛnɛ li ogalu ngwi nu ɛsɛ duu fya mi amah mgban nani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9"/>Ongyesɔ ongwu ta kyɛdɔ ma di gbɔ mi ela okwukwo gbɛɛ: &lt;&lt;Inggisɛ nsunu mmbwaba yi adagyɛ mgban di gbɛ ambɛ mgban mi ebeshu naadi mi abɔ yɔ, <verse eid="REV 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10"/>ongwu kpaa ka wa eneekwɔ itingga mgbi Imgbasho, ngwi a kye yaokɛ mi abumfye mi ibwɛ itingga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibwɛ itingga tso gbɛɛ, a ka gye isɔ ngwi Imgbasho li nu ama nkyitingga mani</char></note> mgban nani. A dika nun isɔ yi ola ofufu odaka mi inai engyesɔ osaan bɛyi inai Ongwummala. <verse eid="REV 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11"/>Man iwu isɔ mgbi ama ka du nghataa gyegwu. Onya dzɛma ba otu yi onɔ mbi ama nsunu mmbwaba na bɛyi adagyɛ mgban, hona mbi ali inggisɛ ngbɛ ambɛ mgbi iyi mgban duu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12"/>Ungwɔnɛ mina itukwu oshiishi mi ayɛ mgbi emi osaan ama nngyo ola mgbi Imgbasho di kwulɛsɛ mi otsitsi mbi iYesu mani.<verse eid="REV 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13"/>Nɛ ani fwo ela kyɛ esho gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kye lɔlu ungwɔnɛni: &lt;&lt;Ogbumse li emi ikwukwɔ ama nkwulu mi ifu Otsɛ wita onɛnɛ nghataa lu iyayi.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 14:13">Onodzi gbela gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɛɛn, a ka tonya mi idɔ mgbi ama okyɔɔkyɔ, lubana okyɔɔkyɔ mgbi ama ka kyɛdɔ ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">A shɛ ɛsɛ dafi a li shɛ etɔ nɛni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14"/>Ani ndinɛ, man akpa gbosa mi iyayi mbi ani, nɛ ongwu nsɔdzɛ mi akpa na ma li inggisɛ ndzɛ &lt;&lt;Dafi Ongwɛ Inggisɛ mani&gt;&gt; yi akata abashi mi ikye bɛyi agɛbɛ ogyigye mi abɔ mgban. <verse eid="REV 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15"/>Nɛ ongyesɔ oka tasɛ mi ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho si wa inggisɛ ngwu nsɔdzɛ akpa na ela gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kyelu agɛbɛ mgbi abu wita oshɛ, ikyekyɛ onɔ oshɛ-shɛ gyɔ, lubana etɔ mgbi ɛsɛ myɛ wa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16"/>Nghanɛ ongwu nsɔdzɛ akpa ma si ngwi agɛbɛ mgban mi ɛsɛ man kyi shɛlu ɛsɛ dafi etɔ mani.<verse eid="REV 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17"/>Ongyesɔ oka di tasɛ mi ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho mi esho, ongwu kpaa di dzɛ yi agɛbɛ ogyigye. <verse eid="REV 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18"/>Ongyesɔ oka kpɔɔ, ongwu nle di mi ola, kyɛ mi iwashi wa wa ongwu ndzɛ yi agɛbɛ ogyigye na ela gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;kyi kyelu agɛbɛ mgbi abu ogyigye na kye shɛlu awawa ekwɔ onaana mi ɛsɛ, ikyekyɛ etɔ mgban obube myɛ wa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19"/>Ongyesɔ na ngwi agɛbɛ mgban mi ɛsɛ man kye shɛlu awawa ekwɔ onaana obube ntonani. O gbe ma ngwuta yaokɛ ishɛ imbe ngwi a kye afɔ jiyɛ ma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Awawa ekwɔ onaana na a li gbe yaokɛ ishɛ kye afɔ tɔdɔ ma ikye okye kalu eni yɛɛ eneekwɔ</char></note>, otso itingga mgbi Imgbasho. <verse eid="REV 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20"/>Ishɛ ngwi a kye afɔ tɔdɔ ma ma dzɛ ifu ogalu ba. Nɛ eyi si fɛ tɔ mi ishɛ na shigbo mɛ o dɔ mmya onbukwɔ, fɛ lu dafi imai ideli onyi yi ngwusenɛ sini.<verse eid="REV 14:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Engyesɔ egyafa yi isɔ egyafa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1"/>Ani di ambɛ oka okwulewo kpakpa mi esho; engyesɔ nghi egyafa yi isɔ egyafa emi olɛlɛ, ikyekyɛ yi isɔ ntonɛ itingga mgbi Imgbasho ngyɛ. <verse eid="REV 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2"/>Ani di di ungwɔ ndzɛ dafi onekyoo idzinggi ngwuo yi ola, mi ele ma inggisɛ ama nngha mmbwaba na ika bɛyi adagyɛ mgban yi isɔ mgbi iyi mgban ma kwudzɛ to ele. Ali inggisɛ mgbi ama byi ozuna ngwi Imgbasho gbe nu ma mani <verse eid="REV 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3"/>di shashi mgbi iMose ongbidɔ mgbi Imgbasho bɛyi ashi mgbi Ongwummala gbɛɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">&lt;&lt;Ogbagbadzidzi bɛyi okwulewo li ungwɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">mgbi abu okyɔɔkyɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">Otsɛ Imgbasho onghaangha.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">Ofɛ mgbi abu li otsitsi yi oyɛyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">Utɔ mgbi ɛsɛ duu.<verse eid="REV 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4"/>Li emɛ ka tsio abu ba, Otsɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">di kye mmwɛ nu mi iyi mgbi abu ba?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Lubana li abu yuo le saan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">Ɛsɛ duu kawa sunu abu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">ikyesinɛ ali mgbi abu osaan tsotɔ wa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5"/>Ngwi ungwɔ ntonɛ nyɛ nɛ, ani di a kye kwulu ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho mi esho bɛyi iTabenako Obwɛndɛ nani. <verse eid="REV 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6"/>Mi ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho na, engyesɔ egyafa tɔ yi isɔ nghi egyafa. A wo angwuto ondlɛndlɛ gbosinɛ kwɔ yi okpa abashi bwato igɛgɛ mgbi ama. <verse eid="REV 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7"/>Nɛ onyi mbi atta owamyɛ nghi enɛ ntona kye uga abashi egyafa nu engyesɔ egyafa ntona yi itingga mgbi Imgbasho mi ele kyɛɛ, Imgbasho ndzɛ oshishe gyegwu nɛni. <verse eid="REV 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8"/>Nɛ iwu mi okwɔkwɔ bɛyi mfye mgbi Imgbasho gbɛ ozu na sɔ man inggisɛ onyi kaka ele wuba nghataa isɔ egyafa mgbi engyesɔ egyafa ntona mbwumbwo.<verse eid="REV 15:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Uga itingga mgbi Imgbasho egyafa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1"/>Nɛ ani fwo ela okwukwo kyɛ mi ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho le gbɔ yi engyesɔ egyafa ntona gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kɛ ka kye uga itingga mgbi Imgbasho egyafa ntona yangwuta mi ɛsɛ na.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2"/>Ta ongyesɔ ongwu ababɔ kɛ ka kye uga mgban yangwuta mi ɛsɛ, man indza okpɛkpɛ yi owulewo gbɔfwɛ tɔ mbi inggisɛ ama ndzɛ yi ambɛ mgbi mmbwaba di li sunu adagyɛ mgban mani.<verse eid="REV 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3"/>Ongyesɔ ongwu fan kye uga mgban yangwuta mi onekyoo, man i kyata yɛɛ dafi eyi mgbi inggisɛ ikwukwɔ mani, ta ungwɔ oshishe ama nwoto onekyoo duu kwulu.<verse eid="REV 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4"/>Ongyesɔ ongwu ta kye uga mgban yangwuta mi ekyoo bɛyi ibu, man a yɛɛ eyi. <verse eid="REV 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5"/>Nɛ ani fwo ongyesɔ ongwu nle di mi eni ma gbɛɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:5">&lt;&lt;Abu li emyɛmyɛ mi ikwɔ ntonɛni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:5">abu ndzɛ onɛnɛ di teyi dzɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:5">abu Imgbasho Osaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:5">ikyekyɛ abu dzɛ yi mfye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:5">ogbiikwɔ mi itɔ ofɛ nɛni;<verse eid="REV 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6"/>lubana a dzɛ eyi mgbi emi osaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:6">mgbi abu yi ama ogbɛɛsɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:6">abu di kye eyi nu ma wa dafi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:6">i gbuo yi ama mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7"/>Man ani fwo ela nu uka mi iwashi gbɛɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:7">&lt;&lt;Ɛɛn, Otsɛ Imgbasho Odatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:7">ikwɔ mgbi abu li oyɛyɛ di li otsitsi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8"/>Ongyesɔ ongwu nɛ kye uga mgban yangwuta kyikɛ onɔ, man a nu onɔ mfye odzɛ inggisɛ ola yi otsɛɛtsɛ mgban nani. <verse eid="REV 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9"/>Olola nkwulewo na to ma ta a fya iyi Imgbasho ongwu nle di mi ikye isɔ ntonɛ nɛ ito, kpaa a fwa okyatitukwu di kyile iyi mgban desho.<verse eid="REV 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10"/>Ongyesɔ ongwu da kye uga mgban yangwuta mi itsuutɔ mgbi mmbwaba nani, ta iifu byakpa kyi gbɛlu esutɔ mgban sɔ, man isɔ nu inggisɛ wita ole la ewoma aba mi idɛ <verse eid="REV 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11"/>di fya Imgbasho ongwi esho ito mi ikye isɔ bɛyi indza mgbi ama nani, kpaa a fwa okyatitukwu mi ungwɔ ngwi ama pɛpɛ kyɔ mani.<verse eid="REV 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12"/>Ongyesɔ ongwu gyin kye uga mgban yangwuta mi ekyoo ogbagbadzidzi iYufreti nani, man eni mgban si ngwɔ ikye omɛ ofɛ mi ikye utɔ ama nkyɛ mi onosa mani. <verse eid="REV 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13"/>Nɛ ani di onodzi ibwubwe nghi eta nto dafi aliɔ mani; a tɔ mi ondu mgbi ozumenyi, tɔ mi ondu mgbi mmbwaba di tɔ mi ondu mgbi oyegbɔ atsika. <verse eid="REV 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14"/>A li onodzi emɛsɛ tole kyɔ ambɛ okwulewo, a di li tasɛ kɛ mbi emi utɔ mi ɛsɛ duu, okwu ma kwakye mi ikye egbe ika okwulewo mgbi Imgbasho onghaangha nani.<verse eid="REV 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15"/>Wɛ di iYesu gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Dii, ani ka ba dafi emumyi mani! Ikyese ka dzɛ yi inggisɛ nkwasisa di gbe angwuto mgban tokɛ biyan, ikye ni ongwu ka kyɛ ibiba di kye iba mgban dɛsɛ ba mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16"/>Nɛ onodzi ibwubwe ntona kwu utɔ kwakye mi imbe ngwi a li kwun mi ondu iHibru gbɛɛ Amagidɔn nani.<verse eid="REV 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17"/>Ongyesɔ ongwu gyafa ma kye uga mgban yangwuta mi awo, man ela okwukwo tɔ mi ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho mi itsuutɔ, le gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;I ngyɛ wa!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18"/>Man mmbwo naabɔ, gbaadu, akpala gbo ɛsɛ di suusu kpakpa. Ɛsɛ osuusu onyi kpaa gyɔ yi ongwunɛ waba wita mi onɔ ngwi a ta inggisɛ nghataa ba onɛnɛni, Ɛsɛ osuusu nɛ timbi ngha duu. <verse eid="REV 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19"/>Ogalu okwukwo na gha ayɛ eta, ta ogalu mi ɛsɛ duu gbobu. Imgbasho wɛ Angbodzi iBabyilon man kye ibwɛ eneekwɔ itingga mgbi ongwu kye nun. <verse eid="REV 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20"/>Ali ibu duu tsebyulu, unggwɔ kpaa a di ma wuba. <verse eid="REV 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21"/>Akwutsɛ mmbwo nshe ngwi undo ma mɛ ideli onyi kyɛ esho wa le gyɛ inggisɛ. Man a nya Imgbasho agya mi ikye isɔ mmbwo akwutsɛ nani, ikyekyɛ isɔ na kwulewo kwuba.<verse eid="REV 16:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Owagbai bɛyi mmbwaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1"/>Onyi mbi engyesɔ egyafa ama ndzɛ yi uga ma ba wa gbɔ yi ani gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;kwa, n ka tso abu adɔ okwookwo mgbi andɛfɛ owagbai ongyaa, nsɔdzɛ ikye eni ibyibyi nɛni. <verse eid="REV 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2"/>Utɔ emi ɛsɛ nɛ li kyɔ amah yan, imba mgbi ɛsɛ di li fya mi eneekwɔ amah mgban.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3"/>Nɛ ongyesɔ na kye ani mi Onodzi lu imbe okplagada. Mmana ani di ongyaa sɔdzɛ mmbwaba omuma blɛtɛtɛ a lɔ ito ofya Imgbasho kpatsɛ ewo mbon, o di dzɛ yi ikye egyafa yi agbe iwyo. <verse eid="REV 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4"/>Ongyaa na mɛ ewo mi angwuto omuma vluvlu bɛyi omuma jaan hini, dile kwɔ yi abashi, ikwutsɛ onyina-nyina bɛyi ikwutsɛ okwɔkwɔ mi ifu mgbangyilole. O kye inumbɛɛ abashi ngwi ungwɔ ama okpɛkpɛ bɛyi ungwɔ ama otsiidza mgbi amah mgban woto ele ma byidzɛ abɔ. <verse eid="REV 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5"/>A lɔn iyi mi ebeshu gbɛɛ: ANGBODZI IBABYILON, ONƆ OWAGBAI DUU BƐYI UNGWƆ AMA OKPƐKPƐ MI ƐSƐ. <verse eid="REV 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6"/>Ani di dafi ongyaa na wa eyi mgbi emi osaan le fya mani, eyi mgbi ama nle kyɔ obwɛndɛ mi ikye iYesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 17:6">Ngwi ani din ma i kwulu ani ewo kpakpa. <verse eid="REV 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7"/>Nɛ ongyesɔ na nya ani gbɛɛ: &lt;&lt;Kyɔsinɛ ngwi i kwulu abu ewo? N ka nu abu osa mi iba mgbi ongyaa na bɛyi mgbi mmbwaba ngwi o le tɔ, ndzɛ yi ikye egyafa bɛyi agbe iwyo nani. <verse eid="REV 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8"/>Mmbwaba ngwi abu di nani, teyi dzɛ, onɛnɛ o dzɛma wuba, dika wa tasɛ mi ikplishɛ di lu mi odzili-dzili mgban. Ka kwulu inggisɛ ama nto ɛsɛ, ama a teyi lɔ ma iyi mi afɛ mgbi oshishe ba kyɛ mi onɔ ngwi a ta ɛsɛ ma ewo, mi onɔ ngwi abu di mmbwaba nani, ikyekyɛ o teyi dzɛ, onɛnɛ o dzɛma wuba, nghaduu o dika waba.<verse eid="REV 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9"/>Ungwɔnɛ mina ozoyeye. Ikye egyafa ntonɛ li unggwɔ egyafa ngwi ongyaa na sɔdzɛ efu ntonani. <verse eid="REV 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10"/>A di li utɔ nghi egyafa. Eda toma wuba, onyi kale kyuutɔ ma, oka ma ba wa ba; kpaa non wa ba yɔ, li kyɛmɛ ngwi o ka kyuutɔ mi ongwonɔ gwee ta. <verse eid="REV 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11"/>Mmbwaba nteyi dzɛ, kpaa onɛnɛ o dzɛma wuba na, li utɔ ongwu gyata. O dzɛ dafi egyafa ntonani, kpaa o le ba ikye ni a wa dzilin kyoon.<verse eid="REV 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12"/>Agbe iwyo ngwi abu di na li utɔ nghi iwyo ama ntu esutɔ waba, ama nkawa gbɛ mfye dafi utɔ ononyi yi mmbwaba na di kyuutɔ mi ongwonɔ gwee mani. <verse eid="REV 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13"/>Oweka mgbi ama li ungwonyi, a dika kye owekwo bɛyi mfye mgbi ama nu mmbwaba nani. <verse eid="REV 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14"/>A ka gblika yi Ongwummala, kpaa Ongwummala ka ngha ma ikyekyɛ o li Otsɛ mgbi emi otsɛ di li Utɔ mgbi emi utɔ, ama ndi kyɛ yi Ongwummala ma, li ama ngwu a kwu ma ela kwu-kwu, sadu-sadu ma, a di li ama nkwudzɛ mi otsitsi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15"/>Nɛ ongyesɔ na nya ani gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Eni ama ngwi abu di ngwi owagbai ongyaa sɔdzɛ ele ntona, li inggisɛ, ibyi inggisɛ, agwɔ bɛyi ondudzɛ. <verse eid="REV 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16"/>Mmbwaba bɛyi agbe iwyo ngwi abu di na, ka di owagbai ongyaa na tanyi. A ka non yɛɛ abubɔ di non dzɛ ibiba; a ka gyon ikpewo di kyon toola. <verse eid="REV 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17"/>Lubana li Imgbasho nu utɔ ntonɛ duu tsɛwodzɛ ungwonyi di gbela kye mfye mgbi ama nu mmbwaba nani. A dika kyungwɔnɛ nghataa elodzɛ ngwi Imgbasho gbɔ ma ka mbwumbwo. <verse eid="REV 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18"/>Ongyaa ngwu abu di na li ongbodzi ogalu nle di mbi ali utɔ mi ɛsɛ duu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 17:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Esɛ ogboogbo mgbi iBabyilon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1"/>Ngwi ungwɔnɛ wa nyɛ nɛ ani di ongyesɔ oka kyɛ esho le ba esɛ. O dzɛ yi mfye okwulewo, man okwɔkwɔ mgban nu ɛsɛ gbosa. <verse eid="REV 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2"/>O feela mi ela okwukwo gbɛɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:2">&lt;&lt;Oblu-blu! Oblu-blu li Angbodzi iBabyilon!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:2">O yɛɛ udɛ emɛsɛ bɛyi imbe mgbi ali onodzi ibwubwe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:2">bɛyi imbe mgbi ingwunɔ ama ntsiidza di kyilitukwu.<verse eid="REV 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3"/>Ikyesinɛ ɛsɛ ama okwukwo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:3">tsatsadu wa fyɛbyɛ amah mgban.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:3">Utɔ emi ɛsɛ nɛ kyɔ amah biyan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:3">man ama okyummya mi ɛsɛ nɛ yɛɛ emi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:3">aludu mi ikye imina mgban obube nani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4"/>Nɛta ani fwo ela oka kyɛ esho gbɛɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:4">&lt;&lt;Tasɛ mbon na, emidani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">ikye ni ema ka waabɔ mi ali ibwubwe mgban na ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:4">adzi ni ema ka wo isɔ nka ba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">mbon ntona ba mani;<verse eid="REV 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5"/>lubana ali ibwubwe mgban</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:5">kwutokɛ shigbo to esho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:5">Imgbasho di wɛ ungwɔ ibwubwe mgban.<verse eid="REV 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6"/>Nun dafi o teyi nu abu mani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">kpan mkpa dudɔ mi ungwɔ ngwi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">o teyi kyɔ mani.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:6">Yawon ungwɔ owaawa mi ibwɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">no dzɛ mgban ma wo.<verse eid="REV 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7"/>Nun isɔ yi owulewo kpakpa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">dafi o nu ewon okwɔkwɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">bɛyi oshishe omyɛɛ-myɛɛ mani.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">Ikyesinɛ mi itukwu mgban o tsaabɔ igɛgɛ gbɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">&lt;Mmɛnɛ ani sɔdzɛ dafi Apodza mani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">ani li owakwadɛ ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">ani dika kye abɔ tiko kpaa ba.&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8"/>Ikyenghanɛ, isɔ ka gban sɔ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">ikwongye yi abɔ otiko yi ootse yi owulewo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">bɛyi onenbwa omba enbwa ka ba mbon mi egbe onyi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:8">Ola ka kyon gye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">lubana Otsɛ Imgbasho ogbɔn ikwɔ ma datu.<verse eid="REV 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9"/>Onɔ ngwi utɔ emi ɛsɛ nɛ ama nkyɔ amah biyan di kyɔ oyabɔ mi omyɛɛ-myɛɛ mgban di iwu mgbi ola ogyeegye mgban yɔ, a ka tsukwu di kye abɔ tiko ikyon. <verse eid="REV 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10"/>Isɔ mgban ka wo ma imio, man a ka kwudzɛ fyata le gbɛɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:10">&lt;&lt; &lt;Aho! Aho, ogalu ogbagbadzidzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:10">Eye iBabyilon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:10">ogalu mfye!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:10">Mi obyi onyi ta Imgbasho fwo abu ikwɔ waana!&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11"/>Ama okyummya mi ɛsɛ nɛ ka tsukwu di kyelela ikyon, ikyekyɛ inggisɛ onyi le gya ma okye wuba <verse eid="REV 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12"/>okye abashi yi iyudza onzundzɛ okwɔkwɔ yi akwutsɛ osunse mi ifu mgbangyilole bɛyi akwutsɛ itagwude; angwuto ondlɛndlɛ, angwuto omuma shinishini yi angwuto ovelevele yi angwuto omuma jaan; ali itɔ afutse ama ogbungbɛ bɛyi ali itɔ idabɔ ngwi a kyɔ mi ɛvɛ mnii duu yi ekwɔ ama ofyumfye mmya yi itigbla yi iyudza bɛyi ikwutsɛ osunse; <verse eid="REV 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13"/>okye akwukwu mgbɛ, mgbi otse ogɛ iwu, engyie ofyunfyummya ogbungbɛ bɛyi ofufu otse otoola, eneekwɔ bɛyi engyie olivi, ofumbu osuse bɛyi alakama; mnda yi mmala; mmya yi ungwɔ ogbe okye sha ma; yi emi ofyɛɛ.<verse eid="REV 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14"/>&lt;&lt;A ka gbɛɛ, &lt;Ungwɔ osuse nmina abu otu duu ma lu dzɛ abu ta wa. Aludu bɛyi okwɔkwɔ mgbi abu duu byulu, o ka yɛ tu ma wuba.&gt; <verse eid="REV 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15"/>Ama okyummya ungwɔ ntonɛ nɛ, ntu aludu mbon ma ka kwudzɛ fyata, yi imio ewo mi isɔ mgban ogyeegye. A ka tsukwu di kyelela <verse eid="REV 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16"/>di kwu-ela tɔ gbɛɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:16">&lt;&lt; &lt;Aho! Aho, angbodzi ogalu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:16">nmewo mi angwuto ondlɛndlɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:16">angwuto omuma shinishini bɛyi omuma jaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:16">dile kwɔ yi abashi, akwutsɛ osunse yi akwutsɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:16">osunse mi ifu mgbangyilole!<verse eid="REV 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17"/>Mi ongwonɔ gwee nɛta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:17">onikyɔ aludu mgbi ogalu nɛ bulu ngyɛ!&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 18:17">&lt;&lt;Ali inggisɛ ama ofa iwudza eni, yi ama odzagaba mi iwudza eni duu, yi ama okyidɔ mi iwudza eni, yi ama okyummya nyɛ ongwi onikyekyoo duu, ka dzɛkɛ mbotunto mbyoo. <verse eid="REV 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18"/>Ni a wa di iwu oduudu mgbi ogyola-gyola mgban ma, a ka gbobakwɔ gbɛɛ, &lt;Ogalu oka teyi dzɛma dafi ongbodzi ogalu nɛ jo?&gt; <verse eid="REV 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19"/>A ka gbe abɔ dikye, le tsukwu di kyelela gbɛɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:19">&lt;&lt; &lt;Aho! Aho, ongbodzi ogalu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:19">imbe ngwi ama ndzɛ yi iwudza eni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:19">mi ekyoo okwukwo duu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:19">yɛɛ emi awuya ikpewo aludu mgban!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:19">Mi ongwonɔ gwee ta, o bulu waana!<verse eid="REV 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20"/>Flinɛ won na, emi esho!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:20">Tsookwa won na, emi osaan yi ama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:20">ogbikye iYesu bɛyi ama ogbɛɛsɛ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:20">Imgbasho fwon ikwɔ mi ungwɔ ngwi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:20">o kyɔ yi ema ma wa.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21"/>Nɛ angbodzi ongyesɔ kyi kyelu ofishi nshe dafi onikwɔɔ okpinangwɔ mani kye ngwuta wokɛ ekyoo okwukwo, si gbɛɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:21">&lt;&lt;Yi itɔ abumfye nani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:21">a ka kye angbodzi ogalu iBabyilon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:21">ngwuta lu esɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:21">a ka din wuba.<verse eid="REV 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22"/>A ka fwo ela ozuna bɛyi ungwɔ ogboogbo, yi oca ofoofo bɛyi agba ofoofo, mbi abu wuba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:22">A ka tu inggisɛ idabɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">onyi mbi abu wuba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:22">Ela inangwɔ okpaakpa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">ka dede mbi abu.<verse eid="REV 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23"/>Osa ipitila ka tsotɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">mbi abu wuba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:23">A ka fwo ela obongyaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">ofufɛ bɛyi ongyaa ofufɛ mbi abu wuba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:23">Ikyekyɛ ama okyummya mgbi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">abu nose ngha mi ɛsɛ duu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:23">O nu ɛsɛ duu boofɛ mi obudei mgbi abu.<verse eid="REV 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24"/>A tu eyi mgbi ama ogbɛɛsɛ yi emi osaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:24">bɛyi inggisɛ ngwu a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:24">ngwɔ mi ɛsɛ duu mbon.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Atsa mi esho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1"/>Ngwi ungwɔnɛ wa nyɛ nɛ, ani fwo ungwɔ dafi agwudu otsɛɛtsɛ mgbi ibyi inggisɛ mi esho le wulu gbɛɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:1">&lt;&lt;Tsɛ Imgbasho!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:1">Owatɔ-watɔ yi okwɔkwɔ bɛyi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:1">mfye li mgbi Imgbasho mgbi eyi,<verse eid="REV 19:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2"/>ikyesinɛ ikwɔ mgban li otsitsi di li ayin.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:2">Lubana o ngwɔ angbodzi owagbai ongyaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:2">ongwu nkye ɛsɛ kyi mbee yi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:2">amah mgban ogboogbo na ikwɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:2">Imgbasho yile mkpa kpan ikyekyɛ o ngwɔ engbidɔ mgban.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3"/>A diyɛ wulu gbɛɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:3">&lt;&lt;Tsɛ Imgbasho!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:3">Iwu ntɔ mbon na lu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:3">esho gyegwu-gyegwu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4"/>Engyukwo osudenɛ bɛyi atta owamyɛ nghi enɛ lakɛ esɛ di sunu Imgbasho, nsɔdzɛ itsuutɔ nani. A gbɛɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:4">&lt;&lt;No dzɛ ngha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:4">Tsɛ Imgbasho!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5"/>Nɛ ela tɔ mi itsuutɔ na, le gbɛɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:5">&lt;&lt;Tsɛ Imgbasho mgbi eyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:5">ema engbidɔ mgban duu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:5">ema nli mion,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:5">wita mbi ama oyɛyikpa nghataa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:5">lu mbi ama onghaangha duu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6"/>Nɛ ani fwo ungwɔ dafi agwudu mgbi ibyi inggisɛ, dafi okadu-kadu mgbi eni bɛyi onikyɔ akpala, le wulu gbɛɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:6">&lt;&lt;Tsɛ Imgbasho!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:6">Ikyesinɛ Otsɛ Imgbasho mgbi eyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:6">Onghaangha li utɔ.<verse eid="REV 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7"/>Ni eyi tsatsa di shɛ ewo ta di nun mmwɛ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:7">Ikyekyɛ eba okwokyiikwokyi mgbi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:7">Ongwummala gyɔ wa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:7">ongyaa ofufɛ mgban ma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:7">wewo dzɛ le fɛ-fɛ.<verse eid="REV 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8"/>A kye angwuto ondlɛndlɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:8">nkwɔkwɔ di gbosinɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:8">kye nun gbɛɛ no kyi wo.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 19:8">(Angwuto ondlɛndlɛ nɛ, li ambɛ mgbi ali osaan mgbi emi osaan.)<verse eid="REV 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9"/>Nɛ ongyesɔ na nya ani gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Lɔ gbɛɛ: &lt;Ogbumse li ama ngwu a bɔɔ ma oga ongwi onɔdɛ mgbi eba okwokyiikwokyi mgbi Ongwummala mani!&gt; &gt;&gt; O di kiyayi gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ntonɛ li elodzɛ otsitsi mgbi Imgbasho aani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10"/>Mi odzɛ nɛ, ani gbɛsɛ lankɛ iyayi ikye osu nun. Kpaa o nya ani gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ka kyɔ ngha ba! Ani kpaa li ongbidɔ ungwonyi yi abu bɛyi engwunabu ama nkyɔ obwɛndɛ mi ikye oyɛyɛ mgbi ama mbi iYesu mani. Sunu Imgbasho! Lubana itɔdzɛ mgbi oyegbɔ yɔ, li onu obwɛndɛ ngbosa mi ikye iYesu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ongye otɔ mmya dɔdzɛ <optbreak/> mmya onzundzɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11"/>Ta ani di esho kwulu ladzɛ man mmya onzundzɛ kwudzɛ mi iyayi mgbi ani, ongye otɔn ma a kwun gbɛɛ Oyɛyɛ bɛyi Otsitsi. Yi emyɛmyɛ o li gbiikwɔ di gblika. <verse eid="REV 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12"/>Inɛ mgban dzɛ dafi ola onaabɔ mani, okpapyi dile kwuba mi ikye mgban. A lɔn iyi mi ewo ngwi inggisɛ onyi kpaa ye ba li ongwu yuon ta. <verse eid="REV 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13"/>O meewo mi angwuto ngwi a kye tswokɛ eyi, ma iyi mgban li Elodzɛ Imgbasho. <verse eid="REV 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14"/>Oblakwutsɛ emi esho le kyɛdɔn, le tɔ mmya onzundzɛ di wo angwuto onzundzɛ, ondlɛndlɛ gbosinɛ. <verse eid="REV 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15"/>Okwusunkli ogyigye ngwi o ka kye kwɔdzɛ ɛsɛ tɔ mi ondu mbon. &lt;&lt;O ka kye ma teyi yi okwuta utɔ ashashi.&gt;&gt; O ka nu itingga okwulewo mgbi Imgbasho Onghaangha tɔ, dafi a kye afɔ jiyɛ awawa ekwɔ ni eni tɔ mi ele nɛni. <verse eid="REV 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16"/>A lɔ iyi dɔdzɛ angwuto mi oba agya ita mgban gbɛɛ:</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="REV 19:16">
    <char style="sc">Utɔ mgbi emi utɔ bɛyi Otsɛ mgbi emi otsɛ,</char><verse eid="REV 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17"/>Nɛ ani di ongyesɔ kwudzɛ onɔ, o kwu ingwunɔ ama nle bulu mi esho duu ela okwukwo gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ba wa kwakye yi eka mi onikyɔ oga ongwi onɔdɛ mgbi Imgbasho nɛ na. <verse eid="REV 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18"/>Ba na adzi ni ema gye mmbwɛ mgbi emi utɔ yi emi agyegika yi emi angbodzi inggisɛ yi mmbwɛ mmya yi ama otɔ ma yi mmbwɛ mgbi ali inggisɛ duu, ama nbyi abɔ ewoma yi ofyɛɛ yi ama oyɛyikpa bɛyi ama olɔngbɔ duu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19"/>Nɛta ani di mmbwaba na bɛyi utɔ emi ɛsɛ nɛ yi ama oblakwutsɛ mgbi ama kwakye yi eka ikye ogblika yi inggisɛ otɔ mmya na bɛyi obyi oblakwutsɛ mgban. <verse eid="REV 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20"/>Kpaa a kyi bwalu mmbwaba nani, bɛyi ama ogbɛɛsɛ atsika ama nkyɔ ambɛ ama okwulewo ikye mgban mani. Yi ambɛ okwulewo ntonɛ, o kpagya ama ngbɛ ambɛ mgbi mmbwaba di sunu adagyɛ mgban ma wo. Ama efa duu, a gbe ma ngwuta wokɛ utɔ mgbi udola nle gbɛ yi ofufu odaka mi ele. <verse eid="REV 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21"/>Ama nsisi ma a ngwɔ ma mi okwusunkli ntɔ mi ondu mgbi ongwu nle tɔ mmya mani, man ingwunɔ duu kwakye gye ikwɔ mgbi ama di kwoolo.<verse eid="REV 19:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Onova idubu onyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1"/>Ta ani di ongyesɔ tɔkyɛ esho le ba esɛ, byi ungwɔ okwulu ikplishɛ di byi itse okwulewo mi abɔ mgban. <verse eid="REV 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2"/>O kyi bwalu ozumenyi, ifa tugbe nani, ongwu a li kwun di olodu, naadi iSatan nani, di tan itse mi onova idubu onyi. <verse eid="REV 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3"/>O kyon ngwuta wokɛ ikplishɛ nani, kye tukwulu di kyi kwobɛ ikye otukwun ofɛ ole kpagya ɛsɛ wo nghataa ni onova idubu onyi na wa ngyɛ se. Ni ungwɔ na wa nyɛ yɔ, li kyɛmɛ a kawa dulun mi itse mi ongwonɔ gwee.<verse eid="REV 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4"/>Ani di itsuutɔ, ama nsɔto ele ma li ama ngwu a nu ma mfye gbɛɛ nu ma gbiikwɔ. Ani diyɛ di oshishe mgbi ama ngwu a dzɛ ma ikye mi ikye obwɛndɛ mgbi ama mi odzɛ iYesu bɛyi ikye elodzimgbasho. A sunu mmbwaba na naadi adagyɛ mgban ba, a di gbɛ ambɛ mgban mi ebeshu hona mi abɔ mgbi ama ba. A yɛ wa dzɛ oshishe di kyuutɔ yi iKrestu mi onova idubu onyi. <verse eid="REV 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5"/>(Emi ikwukwɔ angbeka nsisi duu kyɛɛ mi ikwu ba nghataa onova idubu onyi na ngyɛ.) Nɛnɛ li okyɛɛ-kyɛɛ mi ikwu ongwi ababɔ mani. <verse eid="REV 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6"/>Ikyese bɛyi osaan dzɛ yi inggisɛ ama nwodzɛ mbi ama nkyɛɛ mi ikwu ongwi ababɔ nani. Ikwongye ongwu fan dzɛ yi mfye ikye ma ba, a ka li ama ofifɛ mgbi Imgbasho bɛyi mgbi iKrestu dika kyuutɔ biyan mi onova idubu onyi.<verse eid="REV 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ika ngha iSatan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7"/>Ni onova idubu onyi na wa ngyɛ yɔ, a ka shɛ iSatan adi mi obawi. <verse eid="REV 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8"/>Ta o ka tɔ lu oka kpagya ɛsɛ ngwi a kwu ma di iGogu bɛyi iMagogu wo mi ayɛsɛ enɛ ntonɛni, ikye okwu ma kwakye gblika. A mbwo dafi mfyian mi onekyoo mani. <verse eid="REV 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9"/>A gbɔfwɛ kpatsɛ ɛsɛ di lawo imbe emidi Imgbasho lato bɛyi ogalu nkpan itukwu nani. Nghaduu ola kyɛ esho ba esɛ wa kye ma gye. <verse eid="REV 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10"/>Ta olodu, nkpagya ma wo ma, a kyon ngwuta wokɛ utɔ ola nle gbɛ yi ofufu odaka, imbe ngwi a teyi kye mmbwaba na bɛyi oyegbɔ atsika ngwuta wokɛ nani. A kale nu ma isɔ otu yi onɔ nghataa gyegwu.<verse eid="REV 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikwɔ ongwi olɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11"/>Nɛ ani di itsuutɔ onzundzɛ nshewo yi ongwu nsɔdzɛ ele mani. Ɛsɛ yi akpesho tse dzata imbe ngwi o dzɛ mani, nghaduu imbe dzɛma ngwi a ka kɛ ba. <verse eid="REV 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12"/>Ani di di emi ikwukwɔ, ama nshewo bɛyi ama ogyɛngyɛ, kwudzɛ to inai itsuutɔ nani, ta a si kwulu afɛ kwuba. A kwulu afɛ oka, nli afɛ mgbi oshishe nani. A gbɔ emi ikwukwɔ ikwɔ mi ungwɔ ngwi a kyɔ ngwi a di lɔn mi afɛ ntona mani. <verse eid="REV 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13"/>Ekyoo okwukwo gbe emi ikwukwɔ ama nwoto mbon nu, ikwongye bɛyi endzi kpaa gbe emi ikwukwɔ nto mboma ma nu, man a gbɔ ali inggisɛ ikwɔ mi odzɛɛdzɛ ungwɔ ngwi otsungwɔn kyɔ mani. <verse eid="REV 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14"/>Nɛ a kye ikwongye bɛyi endzi ngwuta wokɛ utɔ ola. Utɔ ola nɛ li ikwongye ongwu fan mani. <verse eid="REV 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15"/>Inggisɛ ta ngwu a lɔn iyi mi afɛ mgbi oshishe bayɔ, a kyon ngwuta wokɛ utɔ ola nani.<verse eid="REV 20:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21"/>
  <para style="s1">IJerosalin ofufɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1"/>Ani di di esho ofufɛ yi ɛsɛ ofufɛ, lubana esho ongwi ababɔ bɛyi ɛsɛ ongwi ababɔ nyɛ wa, ekyoo okwukwo kpaa di dzɛma wuba. <verse eid="REV 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2"/>Ani di Ogalu Osaan, iJerosalin ofufɛ nani, tɔ mbi Imgbasho kyɛ esho le ba esɛ, a man dafi ongyaa ofufɛ ngwu meewo sunse saan mi ikye oban mani. <verse eid="REV 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3"/>Man ani fwo ela okwukwo kyɛ mi itsuutɔ na gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Onɛnɛ osɔɔsɔ mgbi Imgbasho dzɛ yi inggisɛ, o dika dzɛ yi ama. A ka li emidan, Imgbasho abuon ka dzɛ yi ama dika li Imgbasho mgbi ama. <verse eid="REV 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4"/>O ka kyi fwɔlu ma etse mi inɛ duu. Ikwongye ka dzɛma wuba naadi elela okyɔɔkyɔ hona akwɔ omaama naadi owulu-wulu, ikyesinɛ ungwɔ ama ogbugbe nyɛ wa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5"/>Ongwu nsɔdzɛ itsuutɔ ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;N le nu alungwɔ duu yɛɛ ofufɛ!&gt;&gt; Ta o gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kyi lɔlu ungwɔnɛ wokɛ esɛ, ikyekyɛ elodzɛ ntonɛ li elodzɛ ogbekabyi ele, a di li otsitsi kpaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6"/>O nya ani gbɛɛ: &lt;&lt;I ngyɛ wa. Ani li Ababɔ yi Olɛlɛ, Owita-wita bɛyi Ongyɛɛngyɛ. Ali inggisɛ ngwu ekweni kwun duu, n ka nun eni mi ibu, eni oshishe non wa ayayi. <verse eid="REV 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7"/>Inggisɛ ngwu ngha yɔ, ka gyokwudɛ ungwɔnɛni, ani ka li Imgbasho mgban o dika li ongwani. <verse eid="REV 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8"/>Kpaa ama omio yi ama onoyɛyɛ ba yi ama ngbe abɔ wo idza yi ama ongwɔ inggisɛ yi ama okyɔ amah yi ama okyɔ obudei yi emi angwula bɛyi ama omwonya duu, imbe mgbi ama ka li mi utɔ ofufu odaka ogbɛ-gbɛ. Nɛnɛ li ikwongye ongwu fan waani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9"/>Nɛ onyi mbi engyesɔ egyafa ama ndzɛ yi uga nmbwo yi isɔ ongwi olɛlɛ egyafa ntona ba wa nya ani gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kwa, n ka tso abu ongyaa ofufɛ, owa Ongwummala mani.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10"/>Ta Onodzi kye ani teyi lu mi unggwɔ okwukwo oshigbo, si tso ani Ogalu Osaan, iJerosalin, tɔkyɛ mbi Imgbasho mi esho le ba esɛ. <verse eid="REV 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11"/>I kwɔ yi okwɔkwɔ mgbi Imgbasho, ma okwɔkwɔ mgban dzɛ dafi mgbi ashua owo onbukwɔ, dafi ikwutsɛ onyina-nyina, gbosa saan dafi idzinggi nle dzɛ nyina-nyina mani. <verse eid="REV 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12"/>Dzɛ yi oka ogbagbadzidzi, nshigbo yi onufɛ ogalu nghi iwyodefa, bɛyi engyesɔ iwyodefa le ngyo onufɛ ogalu ntonani. Mi onufɛ ogalu ntona, a lɔ iyi agwɔ mgbi emi iSrai iwyodefa ntonɛ onyonyi mi ali onufɛ duu. <verse eid="REV 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13"/>Onufɛ ogalu li nghi eta mi onosa yi eta mi aca yi eta mi agwudu bɛyi eta mi onɔdɛ. <verse eid="REV 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14"/>Ikpishi mgbi ogalu na dzɛ yi akwutsɛ nghi iwyodefa ngwi a wo itozu mi ele, mi ali ikwutsɛ itozu na, a lɔ iyi mgbi ama ogbikye Ongwummala iwyodefa ntona onyonyi mi ele. <verse eid="REV 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15"/>Ongyesɔ ngbɔdzɛ yi ani ma dzɛ yi agida abashi omba ungwɔ ikye omba ogalu nani, yi onufɛ mgban bɛyi ewishi mgban. <verse eid="REV 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16"/>A mbɛ ogalu na dafi ayɛ enɛ mani, dafi ngwi i tunto ma, li ngha ngwi i tsɛɛ kpaa aali. O mba ogalu yi okwuta na si difwi gbɛɛ di li imai idubu onyi yi ideli enɛ mi unto, i tsɛɛ di shigbo kpaa ngha. <verse eid="REV 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17"/>O kye mbalu ikpishi mgban man i shigbo dafi okwubɔ ideli onyi ngwusefa dɔn enɛ mi ombaamba mgbi inggisɛ owamyɛ, ngwi ongyesɔ na le kyidɔ ele mani. <verse eid="REV 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18"/>A mbɛ ikpishi na gbosa dafi ikwutsɛ onyina-nyina, bɛkɛ yi ogalu abashi kyoon, gbosa dafi idzinggi mani. <verse eid="REV 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19"/>A mɛ ita ikpishi mgbi ogalu na ingwinda yi ali itɔ ikwutsɛ osunse duu. Ita ongwi ababɔ li ikwutsɛ onyina-nyina, ongwu fan li onbyinbyi vluvlu, ongwu ta li onzundzɛ puu, ongwu nɛ li enotse indrakpakpa otsururu, <verse eid="REV 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20"/>ongwu da li akpalɔ opuu, ongwu gyin li akpalɔ ogloglo, ongwu gyafa li indrakpakpa onyina-nyina, ongwu gyata li enotse ama nkwakye nyina-nyina, ongwu gyanɛ li enotse ndigyɔ nyina-nyina, ongwu iwyo li indrakpakpa odzakpakpa, ongwu iwyodonyi li ayakwule onzundzɛ, ongwu iwyodefa li omuma vluvlu. <verse eid="REV 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21"/>A mɛ onufɛ ogalu iwyodefa ntona mi enotse mgbangyilole, ali onufɛ duu a man mi mgbangyilole onyi. A mɛ onɔɔfɛ mi ogalu na mi abashi kyoon, gbosa le dzɛ dafi idzinggi mani.<verse eid="REV 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22"/>Ani di ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho onyi mi ogalu na ba, ikyekyɛ Otsɛ Imgbasho onghaangha bɛyi Ongwummala li ozu okwukwo mgban. <verse eid="REV 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23"/>Ogalu na mina onɔ naadi ofyia gbɛɛ no tsɛ hona fyia mi ele ba, lubana okwɔkwɔ mgbi Imgbasho li nun osa, Ongwummala di li ipitila mgban. <verse eid="REV 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24"/>Ɛsɛ ka kyikyɛ mi osa mgban, utɔ emi ɛsɛ dika gbe okwɔkwɔ mgbi ama ba ele. <verse eid="REV 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25"/>Egbe onyi kpaa a ka yile onufɛ ogalu mgban tukwu ba, ikyekyɛ otu ka dzɛ imbe na ba. <verse eid="REV 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26"/>Ɛsɛ duu ka gbe okwɔkwɔ yi mmwɛ mgbi ama ba ele. <verse eid="REV 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27"/>Akponyi kpaa ungwɔ okpɛkpɛ ka kaka ele naadi inggisɛ nkyungwɔ ayiwi hona ungwɔ onya ba. Nghaduu li ama a lɔ ma iyi mi afɛ oshishe mgbi Ongwummala ma ta ka kaka ele.<verse eid="REV 21:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Ekyoo mgbi oshishe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1"/>Nɛ ongyesɔ ma tso ani ekyoo mgbi eni oshishe, gbosa dafi idzinggi mani, le fɛ kyɛ mi itsuutɔ mgbi Imgbasho bɛyi mgbi Ongwummala <verse eid="REV 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2"/>nyɛ lu idzidzɛ angbodzi ingɔfɛ mgbi ogalu nani. Mi ali ayɛ mgbi ekyoo na ekwɔ mgbi oshishe kwodzɛ ele, nli wa owawa ita iwyodefa, di li wa owawa mgban ali ofyia du. Afɛ mgbi ekwɔ na di dzɛ mi ikye ongyɛlu ɛsɛ ootse. <verse eid="REV 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3"/>Ikamba onyi ka dzɛ ogalu na wuba. Itsuutɔ mgbi Imgbasho bɛyi Ongwummala ka dzɛ mi ogalu nani, engbidɔ mgban dika sunun. <verse eid="REV 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4"/>A ka di inɛ mgban, ma iyi mgban ka dɔ ebeshu mgbi ama. <verse eid="REV 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5"/>Otu ka dzɛma wuba. A ka mina osa mgbi ipitila hona mgbi onɔ wuba, ikyesinɛ Otsɛ Imgbasho ka nu ma osa. A dika kyuutɔ nghataa gyegwu. <verse eid="REV 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6"/>Ongyesɔ ma nya ani gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Elodzɛ ntonɛ li elodzimɔ di li otsitsi. Otsɛ, Imgbasho mgbi onodzi mgbi ama ogbɛɛsɛ, dɔ ongyesɔ mgban gbɛɛ no kwulu iba tso engbidɔ mgban ungwɔ ama nka kyɔ dzikan-dzikan kyɛmɛ mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">IYesu yɛ kyɛma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7"/>&lt;&lt;Wɛ gbɛɛ, Ani yɛ kyɛma dzikan-dzikan! Ikyese no dzɛ yi inggisɛ ngwu ngyo elodzɛ ama nto afɛ nɛ mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8"/>Ani, iJɔn, li ani fwo di di ungwɔ ntonɛ aani. Onɔ ngwi ani fwo di di ma ma, ani lakɛ esɛ mi iyayi ongyesɔ ongwu nkye ungwɔ ntonɛ le tso ani ma ikye osunun. <verse eid="REV 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9"/>Nghaduu o nya ani gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ka kyɔ ngha ba! Ani kpaa li ongbidɔ ungwonyi yi abu yi ama ogbɛɛsɛ bɛyi ali inggisɛ ngwu ngyo elodzɛ mgbi afɛ nɛ duu. Sunu Imgbasho yuon!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10"/>Nɛ o nya ani gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ka kye elodzɛ ngwi a yegbɔ mi afɛ nɛ nɛ da ba, ikyekyɛ onɔ ma dzɛ kwɛkwɛ. <verse eid="REV 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11"/>Inggisɛ okyɔ obube no kiyayi okyɔ obube, ongwu itukwu le kplɛkplɛ no kiyayi odzɛ yi itukwu kplɛkplɛ. Nghaduu inggisɛ ama okyɔ osuse ka kiyayi okyungwɔ osuse, inggisɛ ndile saan no kiyayi ole saan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12"/>&lt;&lt;Dii, ani yɛ kyɛma dzikan-dzikan! Umba mgbi ani dzɛ yi ani, n dika kye nu ali inggisɛ mi odzɛɛdzɛ ungwɔ ngwi otsungwɔn kyɔ mani. <verse eid="REV 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13"/>Ani li Owita-wita yi Ongyɛɛngyɛ, Ababɔ yi Olɛlɛ, Otiita yi Odondu.<verse eid="REV 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14"/>&lt;&lt;Mse no bɛ ama nkyi salu angwuto mgbi ama, ikyegbɛɛ nu ma wa tu ofɛ ogye ekwɔ mgbi oshishe di tu ofɛ onyɛ mi onufɛ lu ifu ogalu na ewo. <verse eid="REV 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15"/>Ama nto ogalu mi esɛ ma, li obwe yi ama okyɔ obudei yi amah ibwubwe yi ama ogbɔngwɔ inggisɛ yi ama ola angwula bɛyi ama ngwu onya omwaamwa kpa ma di li kyungwɔ ama ntishi ba mani.<verse eid="REV 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16"/>&lt;&lt;Ani, iYesu, dɔ ongyesɔ mgbi ani esɔ ikye okye obwɛndɛ nɛ nu ema mi ikye okwakye mgbi ama onoyɛyɛ. Ani li akpa yi etɔ mgbi iDevedi, di li oshɛbɛ ongwi ikyegbe nani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17"/>Onodzi bɛyi ongyaa ofufɛ gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kwa!&gt;&gt; Ma ali inggisɛ nfwo odzɛ nɛ no gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kwa!&gt;&gt; Ali inggisɛ ngwu ekweni dɔn, no ba; inggisɛ ndi mina, no gbɛ umba mgbi eni oshishe ayayi.<verse eid="REV 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18"/>Ani iJɔn kwo ali inggisɛ nfwo elodzɛ ngwi a yegbɔ mi afɛ nɛ adɔ: Ni inggisɛ ta mbwo ungwɔ mi ele, Imgbasho ka mbwo otsungwɔn isɔ ngwi a lɔ mi afɛ nɛni. <verse eid="REV 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19"/>Ma inggisɛ ta ndi mwa elodzɛ mi afɛ ngwi a yegbɔ nɛ ngwuta, Imgbasho ka kyi kyelu ayɛ umba mgbi ekwɔ mgbi oshishe bɛyi ogalu osaan mgban, ngwi a lɔ ma mi afɛ nɛ mbon.<verse eid="REV 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20"/>Ongwu nkyɔ obwɛndɛ mi ungwɔ ntonɛ ma gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɛɛn, ani yɛ kyɛma dzikan-dzikan.&gt;&gt; No dzɛ ngha. Ba, Otsɛ iYesu.<verse eid="REV 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21"/>Elela mgbi Otsɛ iYesu no dzɛ yi emi ongwɛ Imgbasho duu.<verse eid="REV 22:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22"/>
</usx>
